<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Ombo</book>
  <para style="h">MALEKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Maleko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Besako belɔti be Yesu Kilisito <optbreak /> wɛɛnte baandiki MALEKO</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALEKO</para>
  <para style="imt">WIINGELELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Maleko kaandiki linɛ libuku. Baweelelaki nde lonkinɛ Yɔani-Maleko (Bisima be baeki 12.12). Ɔnɛ Maleko phaiki ɔmɔɔ asamba baeki jooumu laaphee. Kinaki aiki nde ɔmɔɔ asamba banto bakɛndaki la Pɛtɛlɛ. Pɛtɛlɛ weeki ba Yesu Kilisito. Besao ike asamba bengo beandiki Maleko aliko la Yesu Kilisito, aoki mbetela ɔnɛ Pɛtɛlɛ. Maleko aandiki linɛ libuku aliko asimele bane bataika Bayuda besako bɛlɔti. Ndako aandiki linɛ libuku, phasɔmaki lilako litango ŋango bakee Matayɔ. Maleko ombo ɛnya nte Yesu Kilisito olende Bɔna a Kanamombe lonkinɛ Bɔna a Onto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lonkinɛ, ɔmwɛnya nte Yesu waandi aliko akambele banto la mbwipasha mpato aliko la mbwa kakola. Bengo besako aɔsɔna mbo eba e Maleko 10.45. Ango Yesu ombo lɔnda nte: «Aliko nte lemi Bɔna a Onto, la lemi pha mandi aliko la linkambela. Kinaki, mandi aliko la lemi nkambelana la mpasha luiko lami, nkakole banto ike».</para>
  <para style="ip">Maleko ombo lɔnda aliko la mbotama ya Yesu la likɛnda jande. Kinaki, ombo lɔnda aliko la besako be Yesu ango, Yesu aiki ndako ole waiyolo. Manja iima ya otamboka nende e iima joomu, Maleko ɔmwɛnya bingo bekiisa Yesu e wooni ba Galilaya. Manja eteni e iima e joomu la ɛmɔɔ mbiya nende e joomu la isamalo, ombo ɛnya bingo bekiisa Yesu e wooni ba Yudeya la Yɛlusalɛma. E kantunda, ombo lɔnda aliko la libweelo ja Yesu la ntondwa yande. Asamba ma buku lalikuli banɛi be besako belɔti be Yesu Kilisito, libuku ja Maleko liyalaka jiumbe. Otema ba linɛ libuku, besako bɛnɛnɛ be kekemisa Maleko ko bintɔmpɔ bekiisa Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yɔani oso mbatisa ombo lɔngɔsɔlɛla Yesu mboka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-11">Mat 3.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:2-16">Luk 3.2-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ena ŋango Besako Belɔti be Yesu Kilisito, Bɔna a Kanamombe bemoanja. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ŋango waandikami kako e libuku ja wɛɛni* Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Kanamombe alɔndi, lakondo toma botomi ami wɛɛni Isaya akotangolele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">Aliko akolɔngɔsɔlɛlɛ mboka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />«Bonto ɔmɔɔ ole woosowe* ombɔlɔnda la joi linɛnɛ nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‹Lɔngɔsɔlɛla nyo Bɔkɔta mboka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Sɛngɔla nyo kaama kaeta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40.3</ref></char></note>›».<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Kako nkango Yɔani oso mbatisa apaseli woosowe ba wooni ba Yudeya. Aiki nde atasimela banto nte: «Engola bolengo banyo la mbatisama nyo la Kanamombe akondo ko sokolela nyo njambi yanyo.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Banto lalikuli ba wooni ba Yudeya la banto ba bɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma baandaki boleka ba Yɔani. Bango banto balɔmbi ŋandi aliko la njambi yaɔ la ndako mbwa batisa otema ba losi ba Yɔlɔdani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yɔani alɔti bisenda bisɔnami la lɔɔwa la nyama ɛmɔɔ etaelelama Ngamiya. La ndɔta bɔya ba lɔɔwa e joombo jande la lilɛ jande jaiki nde mpande la obwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Alɔndaki la banto nte: «Ɔnɛ ataande ɔkɔngɔ lami ndako kole la nkulu lindeka lemi, phalaɔsɔna koonga minama nɛmɔla nkɔli ya toposo tande. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Lemi, nende latakobatisa nyo wiiloko, kinaki, ndako, akondo kobatisa nyo la Lɔkɛngɛ-Lɔɛlɔ».<figure style="fig" alt="Jean-Baptiste prêche au sujet de Jésus " file="WWA0389b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="1.8">Yɔani oso mbatisa ataekya banto aliko la Yesu manda</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔani ombo batisa Yesu la Bosombo ombo okekela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mat 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Weengo eleko, Yesu aimi e wooni ba Nasaleti la e bɔsɛngɛ ba Galilaya. La Yɔani oke mboo batisa otema ba losi ba Yɔlɔdani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ango Yesu aimi ndako e losi, kako nkango aɛni loola lomboliphwa, la Lɔkɛngɛ-Lɔɛɛlɔ oke nkitela aliko lande phoke elenga ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />La otema ba loola, joi limɔɔ like mbokama like nɔnda nte: «Wɛɛ, kole Bɔna ami a mpame ɔnɛ alanga lemi, wɛɛ kombo nangya»!<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Kako nkango, Lɔkɛngɛ-Lɔɛlɔ loke mbɔɔtɔla Yesu oosowe* <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Engo oosowe okɛisa biina baomu anɛi, ole ata kekelama la Bosombo. Aiki engo la nyama ya jaa la biphongo* baiki bata olingita la mbookambela.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maanjiyo ba bolemo ba Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Pa mbokama ya Yɔani e munyɔlɔlɔ, Yesu achwe o wooni ba Galilaya. Aekyaki waanto Besako Belɔti be Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Alɔndi: «Eleko kembosila nkoka, la ekeleka e Kanamombe* kekende sukɛlɛ! Aliko la ingo, engola nyo belengo benyo la imeya nyo Besako Belɔti»!<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ango aetaki Yesu boleka ba wango ba Galilaya aɛni ba lɔwi ba phee Simo ndako la aotwa lande Andele. Baiki bata oke bɔtɛi o wango. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu aosimeli: «Oningite, la lakondo kokɛɛ bɔlɔwi baanto.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Kako nkango, bachiki bɛtɛi bɛbɔ la mboolingita.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ango Yesu achwe otamboka inchɛ aɛni Yakɔbɔ la aotwa lande Yɔani, bana ba Sebedayɔ. Bango baphee baiki otema ba kyombo batalɔngɔsɔla bɛtɛi bɛɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Kako nkango, Yesu abaeleli bachiki isɛɔ Sebedayɔ otema ba kengo kyombo la bakambi, baolingiti Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bonto boso basombo babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Pa ango Yesu la baeki bande bachwaki wɔɔsɛngɛ ba Kapelenaumu. La wiina ba iyinga*, Yesu aingeli otema Baasaŋanelo Beayuda, la aanjisa mbekya banto besako be Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bango baiki waasaŋanelo*, ba sebalali aliko ingo ilɔndaki ndako yaiki la nkulu ndeka nkulu ya Baekisi baɔ ba Isaliya. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Atanemwe otema Baasanganelo baɔ* bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki la bosombo bobe. Kako nkango aokomi: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Kole nke asamba iso la wɛɛ, Yesu a Nasaleti? Waandi nde aliko la ntojaka? Latakoeye Bɔlɔti! Wɛɛ olende Lɔɛlɔ ɔnɛ atomi Kanamombe»!<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu aopangweli la nkulu ongo bosombo la nɔnda: «Kɔwa wɛɛ, la pasa ele ɔnɛ onto.» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />La ongo bosombo bobe opasi ongo bonto la mbɔɔtɛkya la nkulu la mpasa ataokoma.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bako lalikuli baiki ango basebalali ike la baiumbolaki asamba bako: «Nke inɛ? Inɛ ikende inkinɛ mbekya ya kasende ile nkulu! Aliko atalɔndɛ la nkulu! La atapasa isaliya waasombo babe bata wooke!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Kako nkango besako be balaŋani o wooni lalikuli ba Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bakɔnu ike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Pa ingo Yesu opasi e Basaŋanelo* Baayuda, achwaki la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani bachwe e lulu la Simo la Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Baiyisa ango, batani bokilo ande la Simo atalale e likenge, la waale ba empoma; la basimelaki Yesu bongo bosao. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Laango, Yesu ochwe boleka ande, la mbookemela e likasa la mboweemaya. Kako nkango empoma ke opasi. Lonkinɛ, aikichisa ataalambela lilɛ ja ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ango aiki kako likɔlɔ, banto bawɛɛlisa bakɔnu lalikuli la baso basombo. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />La banto lalikuli ba bɔsɛngɛ ba saŋani e lokuke la lulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu aikisa banto ike banɛ baiki la biale ike be ntipha la ntipha. Aiti lonkinɛ basombo ike; la koo nanga bango basombo balɔndɛ, aliko ba weeyaki.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omboekya banto ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mpendu fuɔ, Yesu aemwe, la apasi nchwa kaama kamɔɔ ka bɔɔ, nɔmba nɛmɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Pa ango, Simoni la baina lande bachwe mbo woona; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ango awɛɛni bako, baosimeli: «Bɔkɔta, banto lalikuli batakoone»!<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Laango Yesu abauchisa: «Tochu, wɛɛsɛngɛ bele sukɛlɛ, aliko la mbekya lonkinɛ Besako be Kanamombe waanto bale anɛ, aliko la bingo biandeli lemi.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />La Yesu alɛngi la bɛsɛngɛ lalikuli be Galilaya la mbekya banto otema Baasaŋanelo Baayuda la mbita basombo waanto.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya oso nsuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Luina lɔmɔɔ boso nsuli ɔmɔɔ aandi ele Yesu nkɔma balwe otamboka lande la mbooseya: «Iya olangake, aɔsɔna limbikya!» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu awookeli ŋandi. Aosemboleli likasa, la mbookoola la mboosimela: «La langa wiike.» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Kako nkango, nsuli ke sili la aiki. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kinaki, Yesu aopasisa la mbo wɔya lilako la mboosimela: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Yala nyo bii kolɔndake ekambwa ele onto! Kinaki, chwaka loko iɛnyɛ ele weeta atei* la mpasha mpato* ɔmɛnya nte ombwika, solo la isaliya* ba Musa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iya bonto aikyamake aiki atakɛɛ ŋango aliko aimeyame lonkinɛ la banto lalikuli asamba banto aɔ o bolunga. Ɔsɔmɛ Balawi 13. 46, 14.1-32 </char></note> Iya bonto ombwika aiki nde atachu mbwiiyɛnya ele baeta atei nte ombo sila mbika. Aiki atakɛɛ ŋango aliko la nangema la banto lalikuli. Ɔsɔmɛ: Balawi 13.45-46; 14.1-32.<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kinaki, ongo onto achwe la manja nɔnda kaama la likuli. Aliko la ingo, Yesu koo mingela lonkinɛ phololo ɔɔsɛngɛ. Ayalaki bɔɔ la anto la nsɛlɛla nɛmɛlɛ. Koonga ŋango, banto baandaki kande boleka lalikuli.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya oso nɛngɛla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:8">Mat 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Mbeta biina inchɛ, Yesu aiyisa lonkinɛ ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Kapelenaumu. Ango aoki banto nte ole e lulu, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ike asamba bako baandi mingela otema ba longo lulu, nende ŋango bapheki kaama ka njala e lokuke. Bango banto lalikuli Yesu abaekyaki Besako be Kanamombe.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Weengo eleko, banto banɛi bawɛɛlisa Yesu bonto ɔmɔɔ a nɛngɛla. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kinaki aliko la boloi, kotaika la namuna e mbowiyeya ka Yesu. Laango, batɛmɔli nsambe e lulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda bamɔɔ baiki bataliphe ntɛmbɔ ya mbulu yaɔ la mpao la aliko la yako baiki bataliphe mapala</char></note>. Mbɛlama laango aiki Yesu atayale. Bakichisaki likenge ingo ja lalelaki boso nɛngɛla. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu aɛni lokani laɔ, laango ɔlɔndi la oso nɛngɛla: «Bɔna ami, njambi yabɛ imbosokolama».<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Otema ba longo lulu kaiki nde Baekisi bamɔɔ ba Isaliya*. Baanjisa mbwiumbola waasolo baɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Aliko laanke ɔnɛ onto atalɔndɛ ŋaanɛ? Atatole Kanamombe! Nani aɔsɔna nsokola njambi ya onto, Kanamombe nɛmɛlɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ango aei Yesu nte batakanya ŋango waasolo baɔ, aasimeli: «Aliko laanke bitakanya nyo waasolo banyo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ekambwa nke embosaliya, o nɔnda ele boso nɛngɛla: ‹Njambi yabɛ imbɔ sokolama› ao bɔlɔti nɔnda ‹Emala-wɛɛ, ɔsa likenge jabɛ la ɔkɛndɛ?› <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Eeh bɔlɔti oka binɛ, Lemi Bɔna a Onto kole la nkulu ya nsokola njambi o wooni».</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:10">Laango Yesu ɔlɔndi la ongo aiki ombo lɛngɛla: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Mbokosimela: Emala wɛɛ, kemela likenge jabɛ la utola kabɛ»!<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Kako nkango, lonkinɛ bako lalikuli baolendaki, bonto omweemala, okemeli likenge jande la nchwa kande.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">Ba sebalali bako lalikuli. Bakuchaki Kanamombe la nɔnda: «Totaenaka jɛ be ŋaanɛ»!<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omboweelela Lawi aliko aolingite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Pa ango, Yesu achwe lonkinɛ wɔɔkɔngɛ ba eliya ba Galilaya. Boloi lalikuli boolingiti la aanjisa mbo ba ekya. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ango aiki ndako e lɔkɛndɔ, aɛni bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Lawi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawi olende ataelelama lonkinɛ Matayo, ɔsɔmɛ Matayo 9. 9-13</char></note> Lawi ko ongo bata weelela lonkinɛ Matayɔ, bɔna a Alufe. Ongo Lawi aiki atayale kaama kandipisa kodi. Yesu aosimeli: «Oningite lemi»! Kako nkango Lawi aemali la aolingiti.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Pa ingo, Yesu achwe ndɛ e lulu la Lawi. La e longo lulu kaiki nde baso ndipisa kodi ike la baso njambi balɛɛki la Yesu kaama kamɔɔ la baeki* bande, aliko banto ike ba ongo bolengo baolingitaki. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ango Baekisi ba Isaliya* la boloi Baafalisayɔ*, baɛni atale la baso njambi la baso ndipisa kodi laango baumboli baeki* bande: «Aliko laanke weekisi anyo atale le baso ndipisa kodi la baso njambi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Ango aoki Yesu ingo, aasimeli: «Kapha banɛ balɔti bale la mposa e muŋanga, kinaki bakonu! Phamandi, mona balɔti otamboka ba Kanamombe, kinaki baso njambi».<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nɔmba aliko la nkila lilɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Wiina ɔmɔɔ, baeki* ba Yɔani boso mbatisa la Bafalisayɔ baiki e malɔmbi ba kɛɛmaki koo ndɛ. Laango, banto baandi mumbola Yesu: Aliko laanke baeki ba Yɔani la ba Falisayɔ batakɛɛ malɔmbi koo ndɛ, kinaki banɛ baɛ phaata kɛɛ? <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu aasimeli: «Atakanya nyo nte baelelami ba libela baɔsɔna nkila ndɛ ango bɔsɔngi ole laako? Jɛɛ! Iya bɔsɔngi ole laako phaaɔsɔna nkila ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kinaki eleko eandaki ongo bɔsɔngi akondo sakolama; luina longo, baanjaki malɔmbi ba nkila lilɛ.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Koo onto ɔsɔnaka yaati ya esenda e kasende aliko la engo etango. Iya ŋango, ingo yaati ya esenda ekasende kekondo ata engo yaati ya esenda etango laango kaama ka mbatema kakondo nɔna lonkinɛ.<verse eid="MRK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />«Lonkinɛ, koo onto okichaka difai otema ba lophata la lɔɔwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baiki batalɔngɔsɔla mpata yaɔ la nkɔwa, baiki batakicha otema iloko, babɛlɛ la bauta. Longo lophata aiki lako loloko lakasende laiki nde lataulanga, kinaki iya loyalake lokee latakongola loke loolo la mbetela ango phalaulanga lonkinɛ. </char></note> Bayuda baiki batalɔngɔsɔla lophata la lɔɔwa. Otema ba longo lophata bakichaki iloko la babɛlɛ la difai la bauta. Longo lophata laiki nde lataulanga kinaki ango aiki lako pa nkongola loke nkulu laango phalaɔsɔna lonkinɛ mbulanga. Aliko iya bambokɛɛ ŋango, difai ja kasende ja ɔsɔna mbata longo lophata la lɔɔwa. Laango longo lophata, la ingo difai ja kasende yakondo nfutana. Kinaki, bakichaka wiina lalikuli difai ja kasende otema ba lophata la lɔɔwa la kasende»!<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la wiina ba Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Wiina lɔmɔɔ la Sabato* Yesu la baeki* bande batenyanyisa bibeli. Baeki bande ele bako bayaleli mpolola betuwa be ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Laango Bafalisayɔ balɔndi la Yesu: «Lenda aliko laanke baeki* babɛ batakɛɛ binɛ bile Isaliya* yaso phayalange nkɛɛ wiina la Sabato*?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu abauchisa: «Otasɔmɛ nyo ingo akɛisa Bɔkɔta Daudi ango aiki ndako la mposa la aiki la botala, ndako la baso kande? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Aingeli e lulu la Kanamombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Weeleko ba Bɔkɔta Daudi, lulu la Kanamombe laiki nde lotaphikama ɛ Yɛlusalɛma.</char></note>. Weeleko ba Bɔkɔta Daudi, lulu la Kanamombe laiki nde lota phikama e Yɛlusalɛma okemeli kitumbula kengo ke pasisa banto e mpato ele Kanamombe alee, lonkinɛ aɔyisa bango banto bitumbula, laango bingo bitumbula Baeta atei ba Kanamombe bako atoo basani ndɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Sa 21.2-7; Wal 24.9; 2Sa 15.3; Bal 24.9.</char></note>. Akɛisa ŋango ango Abiatali aiki weeta atei* ɔnɛnɛ ba Kanamombe.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Luina la Sabato* la kɛɛmi aliko la onto, kinaki bonto atakɛɛma aliko la Sabato*. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ɛna aliko la ingo lemi Bɔna a Onto kole ɔmɛlɛ Sabato*».<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bonto ɔmɔɔ wiina ba Sabato*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Pa ingo, Yesu aingeli lonkinɛ o lulu laa Saŋanelo Laayuda*. O longo lulu kaiki bonto ɔmɔɔ ɔnɛ aiki luambo lombo lɛngɛla. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Banto bango baolendaki Yesu mɛ aliko la mɛna iya aɔsɔna mbikya ongo onto luina la Sabato* aliko la mba luakwa la mboositaka.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />La Yesu ɔlɔndi la oso nɛngɛla Luambo: «Emala wɛɛ, chwaka asamba banto.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aumboli bango baiki ango otema ŋaanɛ: «Isaliya* yaso ya ɔsɔna nɔnda nkɛɛ bɔlɔti ao bobe wiina ba Sabato*? Ao njaka bonto ao mbo wiikya?» Kinaki koo nɔnda ekambwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Aliko la ingo, Yesu aalendi bako lalikuli la baiso ba nkɛlɛ, aliko la basolo baɔ baolo. Laango ɔlɔndi la oso nɛngɛla: «Sembola luambo labɛ» osemboli luambo lande la mbika kako nkango. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bafalisayɔ bapasi Waasaŋanelo Beayuda* la basaŋani la jeemba ja Bɔkɔta Elode* aliko la munga yuungu ya njaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banto la wiike balingiti Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu lonkinɛ, aipasisa ango la baeki* bande la bachwe ookongɛ ba eliya ba Galilaya. Boloi bɔmɔɔ baanto boolingiti. Bango banto baandi o booni ba Galilaya la bankinɛ e wooni Baayuda. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />La bankinɛ baandi ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛlusalɛma, bankinɛ e wooni ba Idume la bankinɛ wɛɛsɛngɛ bele mpamba la losi la Yɔlɔdani la bankinɛ mpamba la bɛsɛngɛ ba Tile la Sidoni. Balingitaki Yesu aliko nte baokaki mbingo bikɛɛki ndako.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ango aɛni Yesu ŋango asimeli baeki* bande nte baweela kyombo aliko la boloi botaophikake. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Laango, aliko ataekya banto ike. Laango bango lalikuli baiki nkɔna baiki batatindana aliko bako baokoole. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />La ango bango baiki la basombo babe, bakomaki balwe otamboka lande la mbokoma la nkulu la nɔnda: «Mbɔ wɛɛ, kole bɔna a Kanamombe!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kinaki Yesu ophangweli ike basombo batalɔndake ŋango wiiki ndako ele banto.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo sɔna baeki bande joomu laaphee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-16">Luk 6.1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Lonkinɛ Yesu auleli eliko la bɔɔkɔ. Aeleli banto banɛ balangi ndako nɛmɛlɛ, la bachwe engo eiki ndako. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ango aiyisa bako ango. Asɔni joomu laaphee asamba bako la aaŋunyisa lokombo la baeta atei*. Akɛɛ ingo aliko bayale la ndako la mbwatoma aliko la nchwa bataekya besako bɛlɔti waanto, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />La abaɔyisa lonkinɛ nkulu ya mbita basombo babe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ɛna nkombo ya bango baeta atei* joomu la aphee: Simo (ongo Yesu auŋunyisa ndako lokombo la Pɛtɛlɛ), <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />La Yakɔbɔ la aotwa lande Yɔani, bako baphee baiki nde bana ba Sebedayɔ (lonkinɛ Yesu aaŋunyisa Bɔanɛlɛgɛsɛ, ko nɔnda ''Bana ba likongola'') <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Asɔni lonkinɛ Andele la Filipi la Batelemi la Matayɔ la Tomasi la Yakɔbɔ bɔna a Alufe. Tadeyɔ la Simo banto ba boloi ba Elɔtɛ, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Asɔni lonkinɛ Yuda Esikaliyɔtɛ, ɔnɛ a phaki Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baotwa la Yesu batawoone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Pa ango Yesu autoli otema ba lulu. Boloi bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ baanto boolingiti otema ba lulu. Aliko la ingo Yesu la baeki* bande bapheki namuna ɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ango aoki baotwa la Yesu ingo, bachwe mbo wɔɔsa, aliko balɔndaki: «Iyɛɛɛ ombo sema»!<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Baekisi ba Isaliya* baandaki mima e Yɛlusalɛma balɔndaki nte: «Yesu ombo kemelama la Belisebuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Belisebuli ko lokombo lonkinɛ la Bosombo.</char></note>. Lonkinɛ balɔndaki nte Belisebuli olende waiyolo baa Sombo babe la Yesu ataite Basombo e lokombo lande.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Laango Yesu aeleli Baekisi ba Isaliya* la aasimeli weemanu nte: «Namuna nke Bosombo aɔsɔna mbwiita? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Iya banto ba ekeleka ɛmɔɔ bajakanake la inkinɛ ekeleka, ingo ekeleka phɛɔsɔna nsikamela; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />La iya banto ba jooti limɔɔ ba jakanake la linkinɛ jooti phaja sikamela lonkinɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Iya lonkinɛ Bosombo aphakake nkulu yande imɔɔ la ajakanake la onkinɛ, nkulu yande imbo sila.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Koo onto aɔsɔna mingela e lulu la onto a nkulu la mbɔsa bikambwa bende, iya ataɔlɛmɛ obi ongo onto. Kinaki pa mbɔɔlɛma, aɔsɔna mbɔsa bikambwa lalikuli bitanemwe ongo otema.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />«Mbokosimela nyo, kolende sɔlɔ: Kanamombe phaɔsɔna nsokola baso njambi la bango bata otole. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kinaki ɔnɛ atola Lɔkɛngɛ-Lɔɛlɔ Kanamombe phaosokolela jɛ, aliko njambi yande yakondo yalaka la ndako biina lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu aasimeli ŋango, aliko baikisi ba Isaliya* balɔndaki nte olende la Bosombo bobe».<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lele la baotwa la Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Pa nyɛŋɛnde la baotwa la Yesu baandi la nsɛlɛla anja. Baiki anja batomi bonto nchwa mbo weelela. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />E longo lulu boloi bɔnɛnɛ ba anto baiki batayale batalɛngɛ Yesu. La aasimeli: «Oka! Nyɛŋɛbɛ la baotwa labɛ balende anja bata kuumbola.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu awuuchisa: «Nyɛŋɛmi ko nani la baotwa lami ko ba nani?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aalendi banto baiki bataɔlɛngɛ la nɔnda: «Ɛna nyo: Nyɛŋɛmi la baotwa lami ko banɛ bale anɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />E kantunda ɔnɛ akɛɛ ŋango alanga Kanamombe, ndako kole aotwa lami la botamba ami la nyɛŋɛmi».<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba Booni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Pa ingo, Yesu aiki lonkinɛ atabaekya ɔɔkɔngɛ ba eliya ba Galilaya. Boloi bɔnɛnɛ baanto baandi mbɔɔlɛnga la aingeli otema ba kyombo la nsɛlɛla. La Kyombo kiiki e wango la banto baiki e ŋondi sukɛlɛ la iloko. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yesu abaekyaki bikambwa ike weemanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:2">Weengo bemanu aasimelaki: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Oka nyo! Luina lɔmɔɔ, bonto ɔmɔɔ achwe weebeli mwaŋela boopho. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ango aiki ndako ata mwaŋela boopho, binkinɛ bimuka bekwaaki o mpamba la mboka: mpulu yaandi la mpikola lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Binkinɛ bimuka bikwaaki e lɔmɔtu laabwɛ lɔnɛ laiki la lɔmɔtu inchɛ. Mbeta eleko inchɛ bimuka bemeni, kako nkango aliko lɔmɔtu lotaiki ike. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kinaki ango a kangi yaani, ya tumbi bana baete lalikuli: yaomi aliko lɔmɔtu laiki inchɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Binkinɛ bimuka bekwaaki o baumba. Ango bango baumba baanjisa mbola, be phiki la koo mbota lonkinɛ mbuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Kinaki, inkinɛ mbuka bekwaaki e lɔmɔtu lɔlɔti; bingo bimuka bɛmɛni bɛooli la bɛoti mɛjɛmbɛ ike binkinɛ bɛoti baomi asatoasato binkinɛ baomu asamaloasamalo la binkinɛ miyamiya.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Pa Yesu ombo lɔnda: «Oka nyo bɔlɔti, ɔnɛ ole la batoi ba mboka aoke»!<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maana ba Yesu nɔnda weemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ango Yesu aiki nɛmɛlɛ opholi, baeta atei la baeki bande joomu laaphee la bango ba ɔlɛngaki bawuumboli nte aasimele maana ba bengo bemanu.<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu abauchisa: Nyo, abaɛyi nyo yuungu ya ekeleka* e Kanamombe; kinaki bankinɛ baokaki too batalɔndɛ weemanu, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Aliko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">«Bale la baiso kinaki phaɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">bale laatoi phaaoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">iya jɛ, baandaki ele Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">la Kanamombe akondo basokolelaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 6.9-10; Yoa 12.4; Bsb 28.26-27.</char></note>»!<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɔmbɔ lɔnda bomanu ba Wooni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Lonkinɛ Yesu ɔlɔndi la banto: «Phata oke nyo bɔnɛ bobanu? Namuna nke eoka nyo bɛnɛ benkinɛ bemanu? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Bimuka bingo booni a oni bilende besao be Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bimuka bekwaki mpamba la mboka bita elama la bango baokaki besao, kinaki bosombo mbiya la mpasha waasolo abɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />La bingo bikwaaki e lɔmɔtu laabwɛ bale bata elama la bango bata oke besao be Kanamombe la makola la nsaki. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kinaki, bepha la bejo. Beta kemela nde biina besali. La ango aanda toakola ao njakema aliko la besako be Kanamombe, bakondo tata loango lokani laɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bimuka bingo bikwee o baumba bile bita elama la banto bata oke besao be Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Kinaki, toakola ta wooni, la nombo la nanga ya kila namuna yatabaingela, aliko la ingo yataphike besao la phayaote ekambwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />La ingo bɛkwɛɛ e lɔmɔtu lɔlɔti yata elama la banto bata oke besao, la mimeya yataote bimuka. Bimɔɔ bita ote baomu asatoasato, la baniknɛ baomu basamalobasamalo la baniknɛ miyamiya».<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jɔɔmbɔ ja litala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aasimeli: «Bonto aɔsɔna ntoola litala la nkukumya la ephaka ao nkicha entina la likenge? Jɛ! Kapha aliko la nkicha e lɔkɔphɔ weephele? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ko ŋango bosao bataisama buiswaki anja luina lɔmɔɔ, la bosao bole e yuungu bakondo eyamaka aanja. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ongo ole la batoi ba mboka aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Besao bɛnɛ betaoke nyo, obioke nyo bɔlɔti! Aliko bingo bitakɛɛ nyo aliko la bankinɛ Kanamombe akondo kokɛɛla nyo la mbetela ango. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Aliko ongo ole la ekambwa akondo ɔyama enkinɛ, kinaki ele ongo ole apha la ekambwa bakondo opasha nende engo eyala ndako la kɛko».<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bimuka be mɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu ɔmbɔ lɔnda lɔnkinɛ: «Ekeleka e Kanamombe embo elama la bonto ɔmɔɔ aoni ebeli ende. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Bingo bimuka bitatunde bocho la yaani, kinaki, koo mbeya ŋaande bemenaki bɛko, bengo bimuka ango alalaki ndako la memwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Eya nyo nte lɔmɔtu lɔmɛlɛ kata mɛnya bimuka: manja obi ntiti, lonkinɛ botuwa koo bimuka la kantunda bimuka wootuwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ango ayala bimuka bimbotunda, ango ka ukaka bonto. Aliko eleko e ukaka banto kembokoka».<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bomanu ba bimuka ba aladani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu ɔmbɔ lɔnda lonkinɛ: «Ekambwa nke eelamya iso la ekeleka e Kanamombe* ao oomanu nke ɛɔsɔna iso nɔnda wiingo? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ingo ekeleka ketaelama la imuka imɔɔ inchɛɛ ba Damani. Ingo imuka ilende inchɛɛ otomuka lalikuli tataone bako o wooni. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Kinaki pa mbwiyona, imbo mɛna la manda imuka inɛnɛ ndeka tomuka toonami woonjoko. Lonkinɛ ombo pasha bitaphe binɛnɛ ingo yaɔsɔna mpulu mpika bilumba wiilenge lenge beetaphe».<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aekyaki banto bemanu ike be ongo olengo. Abaekyaki solo la kepimo ke mboka yaɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kotaika bosao baekyaki ndako koo mbila bomanu. Kinaki ango aiki ndako nɛmɛlɛ opholi la baeki* bande, aasimelaki lalikuli.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo phangwela ɛtɛmbɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Likɔlɔ ja longo wiina, Yesu alɔndi la baeki* bande: «Tosaphwe boleka bonkinɛ ba eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Baeki* bande bachiki lonkinɛ boloi ba anto, bauleli otema ba kyombo engo eiiki Yesu otema. Binkinɛ byombo bechwaki kaama kamɔɔ la bako.<verse eid="MRK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />La ɛna lɔphɛpho lɔmɔɔ loolo laandi, ɛtɛmbɔ ke tekyaki kyombo iloko yaingelaki otema ba kyombo, nende ango aiki iloko yataole e kyombo. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Weengo eleko Yesu alalaki ilɔ ɔɔkɔngɔ ba kyombo, la bɔtɛ atakicha eliko la monga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:38">Baeki bande ba weemoli la mboosimela: «Weekisi, takondo bwa: inɛ phayata kosimela ekambwa?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu aemwe, aphangweli lɔphɛphɔ la nɔnda la Eliya: «Kɔwa wɛɛ!» Laango lɔphɛphɔ la kɔwi la Eliya laiki nde bii!.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu aumboli baeki* bande: «Aliko laanke ole nyo la wɔɔma? Hapha nyo la lokani lami?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kinaki baeki baiki la wɔɔma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:41">Aliko la ingo baanjisa mbuimbola asamba bako: «Bampame! Ɔnɛ onto ole nani? Ɔnɛ nende lɔphɛphɔ la iloko yata wooke»!<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya oso Basombo babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ango Yesu la baeki bande ba saphwaki eliya e Galilaya. Baiye o wooni ba Gelaseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu apasi e Kyombo, kako nkango, bonto ɔmɔɔ aimaki weebeli e baombo la manda mboosaŋanya. Ongo bonto aiki la basombo babe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />La wiiki atayale atei ba baombo. Koo onto ɔnɛ asana mbookemela la mbɔɔlɛma koonga la munyɔlɔlɔ bɔmɔɔ; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Aliko kila wiina banto baɔlɛmaki mbolo wee kolo la minyɔlɔlɔ waakasa, atenaki minyɔlɔlɔ la nkelola ingo mbolo. Koo bonto aiki la nkulu ya mbɔɔlɛmbya. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ongo bonto aaŋangaki bocho la yaani, o baombo la bɛɔkɔ, la ata okoma la mbwi yɔtaya nɛmɛlɛ la abwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ango aɛni ndako Yesu bɔɔ; achwe loango, nkɔma balwe otamboka lande, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />La aokomi la nkulu: «Yesu atalange nke, Bɔna a Onto ole eliko bɔɔ? Mbokolɔmba elokombo, la Kanamombe, konduwanyake!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ongo bonto alɔndi ingo aliko Yesu aosimelaki: «Bosombo bobe pasa ele ɔnɛ bonto!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Pa Yesu auumboli ongo bonto: «Lokombo labɛ nani?» Auchisa: «Lokombo lami ike»,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boloi ba anto. Lokombo lɔnɛ lɔlɔndi lonkinɛ boloi ba Bakɔlɔbɔi 6000 la balɔndi ŋaanɛ wiike ba Basombo babe. </char></note> legion ko nɔnda ike, aliko tolende ike. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />La ongo a memeyaki nseya Yesu ataitake basombo babe anja la bongo booni.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ango kaama kaiki nde boloi bɔmɔɔ ba nsombo balɛɛki sukɛlɛ la bokondi ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Basombo bachwaki la maɔmbi baɔ ele Yesu: «Ototome o nsombo, ɔtɔya loosa tuingele kaɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu abaɔyisa loosa. La bango basombo babe bapasi ele ongo bonto la baingeli wiingo nsombo. Boloi lalikuli baiyoki e eliya la babwe. Baiki ilango elefu iphee. <figure style="fig" alt="Le troupeau de porc se noie dans le lac" file="Wa03846b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.13">Boloi ba nsombo bombolinda weeliya</figure> <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Pa bango banto baiki batachunge nsombo bachwe ntɔla besako e wooni la bɛsɛngɛ baandi mɛna bingo beeti. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Baiyisa mɛ la Yesu la mɛna bonto aiki la wiike baasombo babe: aiki atasɛlɛla atalɔtɛ bisenda la aiki la limanya jande lilɔti. Ɔmɛna bingo bake mbaema la wɔɔma. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Banɛ baɛni bikambwa lalikuli bieti engo, baasimeli banɛ baandi okongo bingo beiyisa ongo onto aiki laasombo aliko la ingo nsombo. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Laango baiki batasɛya Yesu: «Apase e wooni baɔ»! <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />La ango aiki Yesu ataulela e kyombo, ongo bonto aiki, aɔlɔmbi Yesu: «Nchu laɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kinaki, Yesu koo mbo wiimeya, kinaki aosimeli: «Utola kabɛ oolunga babɛ, la oasimele binɛ lalikuli Bɔkɔta okiisa aliko labɛ la ŋango ombo kookela ndako ŋandi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Lonkinɛ ongo onto achwe la manja mbalaŋanya besao o booni ba Dekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20.</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli ko nɔnda nte wooni ba bɛsɛngɛ joomu.</char></note>. Bingo lalikuli bikɛɛ Yesu aliko la ndako; la bango lalikuli baoki basebalali.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya la ntondoya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Pa Yesu asaphwe lonkinɛ la kyombo boleka bonkinɛ ba eliya ba Galilaya. Ango aiki boloi bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ baanto baɔlɛngi. Laango aiki wɔɔkɔngɛ ba eliya. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Laango Bɔkɔta ɔmɔɔ Baasaŋanelo Beayuda, aelelami Yailɔ aiye. Aɛni Yesu, aiyoki weekolo bende. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />La aosɛi la membeleya la nɔnda: «Bophoko ami, okende sukɛlɛ la mbwa, aka mbɔlɔmbɛla aliko aike la ayale o luiko»!<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Laango Yesu achwe la ndako. Bongo boloi boolingiti Yesu la mboo phika boleka lalikuli.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Woongo boloi kaiki wainto ɔmɔɔ aiki la waale ba mpasa bekila bilongi joomu laiphee. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ongo wainto aɛni toakola ike. Baingi ike ba wiingi koo mbika. La osusisha besanga bende lalikuli. Kinaki, ingo koo nkɛɛ ekambwa. Ila kɔweenyisa nde tosoya ike. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Aiki ata oke banto batalɔndɛ aliko la Yesu. Achwe lonkinɛ oo loi, ɔɔkɔngɔ ba Yesu la nkoola esenda ende. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />La ailɔndɛlaki nɛmɛlɛ: "Iya nkoolake koonga bisenda bende, lakondo ika.'' <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kako nkango, bekila bende bike ntena, la aitani ombwika. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kako nkango, Yesu aeyi nte nkulu yande imbokitela. Autoli asamba boloi la aumboli: «Nani onkooli esenda emi?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Baeki bande bawuuchisa: «Wɛɛ ɔmwɛna nte boloi bombo kophika boleka lalikuli, la ataumbola lonkinɛ nte nani omonkoola?» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kinaki Yesu olendi asamba boloi aliko aeye, nani ookoli. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ongo wainto ɔsɔki la wɔɔma aliko oeyi ingo iwiyisa; aandi lonkinɛ mbwi yoka weekolo be Yesu la mboosimela sɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu oosimeli: «Bophoko ami, lokani labe lombo kuikya. Chwaka bii la waale babɛ bombwika!» <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Wiiki atasile nɔnda, banto baandi mina e lulu la Yailo la mboo simela: Hooo! Bophoko baɛ ombosila mbwa; kooluphanyake lonkinɛ Bɔkɔta. <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kinaki Yesu aoki ingo joi koo nanga. La nɔnda la Yailo: «Koyalake la wɔɔma, Imeya ntoo.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Koomimeya koonga bonto ɔmɔɔ aolingite engo echwe ndako, ila Pɛtɛlɛ la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani aotwe la Yakɔbɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Baiyisa ele Yailo, Yesu atani bolupho ike aliko banto baiki batalele la mbokoma. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Oke mingela otema ba lulu la nɔnda: «Aliko laanke bilelo la bolupho? Bɔna atabu, kinaki andalale».<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kinaki baɔɔli Yesu, apasisa banto lalikuli anja, la aingeli e lulu engo eiki bojo ba bɔna la baeki bande basato, la isɛnde la nyɛŋende la bɔna. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu akemeli bɔna o likasa la nɔnda; Talita kum ko nɔnda: «Bophoko mbokosimela emala!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Kako nkango, Bophoko weemali la nkɛnda nɛmɛlɛ. Wiiki nde la bilongi joomu la iphee. Ango aɛni banto lalikuli bingo basebalali. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kinaki Yesu aasimbi nte bonto ataeyake, lonkinɛ aasimeli ɔya nyo ndako lilɛ ale.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Banto ba Nasaleti bambo kila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu mpasa weengo kaama la mbutola e wooni engo eoli ndako; Baeki bande bake mbootindeya. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Wiina ba Sabato*, aiki ata ekya e Basaŋanelo Baayuda. Banto ike bawookaki la nsebalala la nɔnda: «Ende ebai ndako binɛ lalikuli. Nani ɔwɔɔyisa linɛ limanya la nkulu ya nkɛɛ binɛ bintɔmpɔ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ɔnɛ hapha musɛlɛmala, bɔna a Maliya, boolo ande la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔsɛ la Yuda la Simo? La batamba ande phaasɛlɛlaka laso anɛ»? Aliko la ingo koo mbo wiimeya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Laango, Yesu aasimeli: «Wɛɛni* oyalaka la bokuchu kaama lalikuli, kinaki apha la bokuchu ɔɔsɛngɛ bootami ndako la ele jootwa jande la baotwa lande».<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ango Yesu koo nkɛɛ lonkinɛ ɛntɔmpɔ ɛmɔɔ, kinaki la mbaphya bakasa waakonu bamɔɔ la mbo baikya.<verse eid="MRK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />La Yesu asebalali aliko la mpheka mbo wiimeya ya bango banto.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu ombotoma baeki bande joomu laaphee</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Pa ingo Yesu achwe wɛɛsɛngɛ lalikuli be mɛmɛ ataekya banto. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Aelili baeki* bande joomu la aphee la mboatoma bapheebaphee. Abaɔyisa nkulu ya mbita basombo babe. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8-9" />La aapholoti waa toi la nɔnda: «Kɔɔsake nyo ekambwa ɛmɔɔ ɛ lɔkɛndɔ, ila ntanda: lophata ao besanga e mufuko ao esenda ɛnkinɛ, kinaki emba nyo botumbo la tomposo.»<verse eid="MRK 6:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Ango akwɛbɛya nyo bako kaama kamɔɔ, yala nyo e lulu longo nende ango apasaki nyo ango kaama. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Lonkinɛ iya bonto ba osɛngɛ ɔmɔɔ akilake mbwa ɛbɛya ao nkooka nyo, pasa nyo ango. Kinaki e mpasa ango, kokola nyo juutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkokola juuti ko mɛnya nte Baeki bapha la ningo ba mbekya besao be Kanamombe woongo ɔsɛngɛ.</char></note>, bekokemeli nyo weekolo enyo. Ingo yakondo yala lilako kaɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bango Baeki bachwe bata ekya banto lalikuli aliko baengole belengo bɛɔ la mpasa woobe baɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Baphaphi mbita basombo babe ike la mbikya bakɔnu ike la mbwa kila bauta.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libweelo ja Yɔani oso mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Weengo biina, Bɔkɔta Elode aoki batalɔndɛ aliko la Yesu, aliko besako bende biiki bimbo balaŋana kaama lalikuli. Bamɔɔ balɔndi: «Yɔani oso mbatisa ombo tondwa, nkɛko ole ndako la nkulu ya nkɛɛ bintɔmpɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kinaki bankinɛ balondaki: «Ɔnɛ olende Eliya.» Bankinɛ lɔnkinɛ balɔndaki: «Olende wɛɛni, solo la bankinɛ Baɛni batango.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ango aoki Ɛlɔdɛ bingo lalikuli alɔndi: «Ɔnɛ olende Yɔani oso mbatisa! La ɔteni bɔtɛ, kinaki ombo tondwa»!<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Aliko Elode aiki ombosila mpasha isaliya ya nkemela la mbɔɔlɛma Yɔani minyɔlɔlɔ, la mbo wooka e munyɔlɔlɔ. Okeisa bingo aliko Yɔani aosimbi atasɔngake Elodiya, waanja a waankunɛ ande Filipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yɔani aiki ataosimela Ɛlɔdɛ: «Isaliya yaso imbolɔnda nte: phakasane bonto mbɔsa waaja a aotwa labɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Lonkinɛ, Elodiya okichisa nkɛlɛ e lisolo jande aliko la Yɔani la aoni mboojakya, kinaki koo mbɔsɔna, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Aliko, Elode alawaki Yɔani. Aliko aeyaki nte olende bonto ɔmɔɔ a sɔlɔ ele Kanamombe la Lɔɛlɔ. Aliko la ingo aiki ata okenge Yɔani. Ango aoki ndako mbekya ya Yɔani, aiki la libɛla, koo nga ŋango aiki kako kata ɔlɛngya bɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Laango, wɛɛsɛ ɔmɔɔ bɔlɔti weenamwe ele Elodiya wiina ba libɛla ya mbotama ya Elode. Aeleli Bɛkɔta benkinɛ la Bɛkɔta be akɔlɔbɔi la Bɛkɔta bɛɛsɛngɛ be Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Baiki wiingo libɛla, Bophoko ba Elodiya aingeli otema ba kyumba la manja nkɛnya, la nkɛnya yande; ike nangya Elode la banɛ baelelami. Elode aosimeli lonkinɛ ongo baphoko: «Ɔnɔmbɛ lemi engo lalikuli e langa wɛɛ la, lakondo kɔya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Lonkinɛ aosimeli: «Lalikuli e nɔmba wɛɛ lakondo kɔya. Mbokolapela koonga yaati ya ekeleka yami.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Bophoko mpasa la nchwa ele nyɛŋɛnde: aliko la nɔmba lilako: «Nke ɛ lɔmba lemi?» La ndako obuuchisa: «Lɔmba bɔtɛ o too ba Yɔani oso mbatisa.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Kako nkango ongo Bophoko autoli loango ele Elode la mboosimela: «Mbolanga kako nkaanɛ ompaa bɔtɛ ba Yɔani oso mbatisa e lɔphɛphɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Bɔkɔta aoki ingo aomali nkɛlɛ; kinaki koo nanga mbesanya lonkinɛ, aliko olapi ndako otamboka baaso mbelelama. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Kako nkango otomi ɔmɔɔ aa kɔlɔbɔi bande la isaliya ya mbela bɔtɛ ba Yɔani oso mbatisa. Ɔkɔlɔbɔi ochwe e lulu la munyɔlɔlɔ la ntena bɔtɛ ba Yɔani. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Lonkinɛ ombweela bɔtɛ e lɔphɛphɛ la mbɔwɔya bophoko, la ongo oke mbɔya nyɛŋɛnde.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolesha banto ɛlɛfu itano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ango aoki baeki ba Yɔani bengo besako, bachwe mbɔsa bojo bande la nkunja. <verse eid="MRK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ango Baeta atei* bautoli ele Yesu, la baosimeli lalikuli bakiisa la mbekya. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Laango banto ike bachwaki la mbutola baiki ike. Yesu la baeki bande phaiki koonga la eleko e ndɛ. Aliko laingo aasimeli: «Aka nyo tochu njala kaama kamɔɔ aliko oomoye nyo inchɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bachwe lonkinɛ bako amɛlɛ e Kyombo, kaama ka bii. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kinaki banto ike baɛɛni la mbeya engo echwaki bako; bake nchwa lonkinɛ wɛɛsɛngɛ lalikuli be mɛmɛ la mbiya laekolo weengo kaama otamboka ba Yesu la baeki yande. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ango Yesu apasi ndako e Kyombo, oke mena bongo boloi baanto; lisolo jande like mbola la ŋandi aliko laango anto, aliko ba mbelama la boloi bɔmɔɔ bɛɛkoko bole koo okolo. La oke mbwikicha ata baekya besao ike.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kaiki nde likɔlɔ, baeki ba Yesu ba osimeli: «Bɔkɔta, bombo elekwa la engo kaama kolende bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Toma bango anto bachu e nkombo la bɛsɛngɛ bele mɛmɛ nsomba lilɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu oke mbobaucheya: «Ɔya nyo bako lilɛ»! Kinaki bake mboumbola: «Atalange-wɛɛ nte to pashe miya iphee ya besanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali miya iphee: Ko falanga ya mbɔya bokambi o ŋɔndɔ libwa</char></note> miya iphee: yaiki nde besanga bɛmbɔya bokambi o ŋɔndɔ esambaele. Aliko la nsomba bitumbula la mbɔ baɔya ya ndɛ»?<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu abaumboli: «Ole nyo la bitumbula binga? Chwaka nyo lokolende.» Ango aɛni bako, baosimeli nte: «Tolende la bitumbula bitano, la lonkinɛ nsɛ iphee.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Laango Yesu abaɔyisa isaliya basɛlɛlɛ bako lalikuli, wee loi waalilo. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Banto bake n'sɛlɛla boloi ba miya ɛmɔɔ miya ɛmɔɔ la boloi ba baomu batanobatano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Lonkinɛ Yesu akemeli bingo bitumbula bitano la ingo n'see iphee. Aolisa baiso eliko la nkucha Kanamombe. Oke ntena bitumbula la mbɔya baeki bande. Aliko la mphaka ele banto lalikuli. La ingo nsee iphee ophaki waanto lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Banto lalikuli bale la jiimbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ango akɔngi Baeki bingo biteni be bitumbula la be nsee ya tikali, beoli biphaka joomu la iphee. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Bango bampame bale bingo bitumbula baiki wiike baanto elefu itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombokɛnda eliko la iloko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Pa ango, Yesu atomi baeki bande bauleli e Kyombo aliko baete otamboka lande boleka ɔnkinɛ ba losi. Boleka ba wooni ba Betesaida, ango nɛmɛlɛ atikali atalake boloi. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Pa nsila mbwalaka, oke nchwa o bɔɔkɔ nchwa nɔmba.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ango aiki likolo kengo kyombo ke baeki keiki atei ba losi. Kinaki, Yesu nɛmɛlɛ atikali ɔɔkɔngɛ ba losi. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Oke mena nte baeki bande baiki la tosoya ta nduwa, aliko la lɔphɛphɔ nphupha boleka baɔ; o likɛɛlɔ, Yesu oke nchwa boleka baɔ atakende eliko la iloko, la aoni mbwa tanda. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ango awɛɛni baeki atakɛndɛ eliko ja iloko. Bakanyaki nte olende Boyombi la baokomi, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ango bako lalikuli bawɛɛni, bake mba wɔɔma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Kinaki, kako nkango, Yesu oke mbwasimela: «Kekemala nyo, lemi ongo, kolɔwake nyo!  <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Lonkinɛ auleli o kengo Kyombo la lɔphɛphɔ loke ntena. Baeki bake nsebalala, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Aliko koo mbeya maana ba bɛntɔmpɔ be bingo bitumbala: limanya jaɔ jaiki nde liloko joolo.»<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu omwikya bakonu o wooni ba Gɛnɛsaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ango Yesu la baeki bande basili nsaphwa eliya, Bake boleka ba Gɛnɛsalɛti bake nsokya Kyombo la nɛma. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Apasi bako e Kyombo la, Kako nkango, banto baweeyi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Laango banto bake nchwa loango e bioni lalikuli, la mboweela bakonu eliko ja bakenge baɔ, kaama lalikuli eokaki bako nte olekako. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />La Kaama lalikuli engo echwaki Yesu, otema ba wooni la bɛsɛngɛ la bibeli. Banto ba weelaki bakonu baɔ o kaama ka anja la mbwisɛya ele Yesu baokoole koonga ɛnsɔli e esɛnda ende. Bango lalikuli baokooli babe luiko.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo lɔnda aliko la bolengo ba anto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bafalisayɔ* la Baekisi bamɔɔ ba isaliya baandi mima e Yɛlusalɛma baɔlɛngi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baɛni nte bamɔɔ ba baeki* bande balɛɛki laakasa ba ntaka, ko nɔnda ndɛ koo mbokya bakasa baɔ, kolende bɔɔ la isaliya Yaayuda. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Balɔndaki ingo aliko, Bafalisayɔ la bankinɛ Bayuda lalikuli batakucha isaliya ya bankɛɔ la nɔnda nte bonto phaɔsɔna ndɛ lilɛ iya ataokya bakasa ŋango basana kako. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />La ango baimaki wiimomba, phaale iya onto ataɔkya bakasa. La baiki la isaliya ike yaiki bako batakɛɛ phoke mbɔkya bekoyo la mboka la mpoke ya lɔngɔsɔlami la mongo. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Wiingo Bafalisayɔ la Bɛkɔta ba Isaliya baumboli Yesu: «Aliko laanke baeki babɛ phaalingita isaliya yaimi ele bankaa, kinaki batale lilɛ jaɔ la bakasa ba ntaka!» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu abauchisa: Nyo balimbi! Wɛɛni Isaya aiki la Isaliya ango aekyaki ndako aliko lanyo o mandika nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">«Banɛ banto, bata nkucha lemi wɛɛlɔmɔ bɛɔ ntoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">kinaki basolo babɔ bayalaka nde bɔɔ lami.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Aliko linkucha yaɔ lemi iyalaka nde ya linsonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Aliko la isaliya yaɔ yataekya bako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Ilende limanya ja anto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 29.13</char></note>».<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Ochikaka nyo isaliya ya Kanamombe, la ningita besao be anto».<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Lonkinɛ aasimeli: «Olende nyo loango ntika isaliya* ya Kanamombe, aliko la ningita isaliya yanyo! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kapha nte weyaka nyo ŋango balɔndaki Musa: ‹Yala nyo atakuche isɛbɛ la nyɛŋɛɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 20.12, 21.1; Walawi 20.9; Nkanya 5.16</char></note> La lonkinɛ alɔndi: ''Ɔnɛ atola isɛnde aɔ nyɛŋɛnde asana mbwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Mpasa 21.17; Walawi 20.9</char></note>''. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Nyo, olɔndaka nyo nte bonto aɔsɔna nɔnda la isɛnde aɔ nyɛŋɛnde nte: ‹Engo eoni lemi nkɔya kekende <char style="it">Kolobani</char> Ko nɔnda mbosila mphakela Kanamombe.›  <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Okɛɛ ŋango, oke nyo simbaka onto ataɔyake isɛnde la nyɛŋɛnde ekambwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Wiingo bolengo, ombokila nyo isaliya ya besao be Kanamombe aliko la isaliya yaankɛnyo yata ekya nyo. La atakɛɛ nyo bikambwa ike binkinɛ bile kɛlikɛli la ingo».<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bikambwa binɛ bikichaka bonto bobe.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Pa ingo, Yesu weeleli lonkinɛ boloi baanto la nɔnda: «Ombo kee nyo bɔlɔti, nyo lalikuli, la weeye nyo binɛ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Koo ɛnɛ eingelaka otema ba onto mima anja ekichaka bonto bobe. Kinaki ɛnɛ eimaka o onto, ekichaka bonto bobe. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ole la batoi ba mboka, aoke»!<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />«Ango Yesu apasi wooloi la mingela e lulu, baeki* bande bawuumboli bɔnɛ bomanu: Batalɔnde nkee»? <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu aasimeli: «Nyo lonkinɛ phayalaka nyo la limanya? Phaoke nyo nte ɛnɛ eingelaka oonywa ba onto phekeokichaka bobe?» <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Aliko ingo bikambwa phiingelaka o lisolo jande, kinaki biingelaka nde o likundu jande, la mpasa nchwa e nsomba. Waango baoyi, Yesu aoni nɔnda nte lilɛ lalikuli limbo sana nɛɛmwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Ɛnɛ ekichaka bonto obe ko ɛnɛ epasaka ka onto. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Aliko otema, ba lisolo ja onto, ketaime bamanya babe. La bango bamanya babe ketaotome nkɛɛ: loseka, kwiiya la njaka, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Nkɛɛ litola, nanga bile ele bankinɛ la toŋuna la nkɛlɛ, nimba banto, la woomputu, la omanda, nɔnda bobe ele bankinɛ, la mbwiɛmba la mpeka limanya. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ingo bikambwa bibe lalikuli bipasaka nde o otema ba onto la beko beokichaka bobe».<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wainto ɔmɔɔ apha Muyuda ombo imeya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu apasi ango kaama la achwe boleka ba bɔsɛngɛ ba Tilo. Aingeli e lulu lɔmɔɔ, kinaki koo nanga banto baeye nte wiiki ango, kinaki phasane njala ataisama.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Pa ingo, wainto ɔmɔɔ, aiki la bophoko ande aiki la basombo babe, aoki ndako besako be Yesu; la aandi mbwiyoka weekolo be Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ongo wainto phaiki Muyuda, kinaki aiki Mugiliki aotami ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Feniki o booni ba Siliya. Asɛi Yesu aite bosombo bobe ele bophoko ande.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kinaki Yesu aosimeli: «Lɛla obi bana bale lilɛ la jiimbi; Aliko kaphabɔlɔti nkemela lilɛ ja bana la mbokela mbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Wainto auchisa: «Sɔlɔ, weekisi, koonga mbwa, balɛɛka bompusi bongo bokwaka ɛntina la mesa bana bakwɛyaka».<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Laango, Yesu awuuchisa: «Aliko la ingo mbuchɛyama, aɔsɔna mbutola kaɛ: Bosombo bobe ombopasa bophoko abe».<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Autoli ndako e lulu lande, atani bɔna ande ombosembwa e likenge: la bosombo bobe aiki ombosila mboopasa.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya eluma empokolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Pa ango, Yesu mima lonkinɛ e wooni ba Tilo, mbetela e Sidoniya la mbutola boleka ba Eliya e Galilaya e wooni ba Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />La, ba wɛɛlisa bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki eluma la aiki la likokoma, la basɛi Yesu awapheya bakasa.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Laango Yesu aopasisa ooloi baanto, la nchwa lande botandi inchɛ. Aili mpita yande waatɔi ba ongo onto la mboochwela lɔsɔi e lophita lande la mbookobola e lolemu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu aolisa baiso eliko, alɔndi la joi linɛnɛ: «<char style="it">Efata</char>ko nɔnda Liphwa wɛɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kako nkango, batoi baongo onto bake ndiphwa, la lolemu lande loke ndipholama la oke manja nɔnda solo. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu oasimeli batasimelake bonto bengo besao. Kinaki ŋango aasimbaki ndako, ko ŋango baphaphaki bako nchwa batabalaŋanya besako. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />La banto basebalali ndeka; balɔndaki: «Bingo lalikuli bitakɛɛ Yesu bilende bɔlɔti: ombwikya bimpokolo mboka, la biluma nɔnda»!<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolesha banto elefu inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Weengo eleko, boloi bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ bosaŋani lonkinɛ. Ŋango wiiki bako koo lilɛ ja ndɛ, Yesu aeleli baeki bande la mbwasimela: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Mwɛnɛla banɛ banto ŋandi, aliko bakɛndi lami biina esato la koo lonkinɛ lilɛ ja ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Iya mbwa tomake kaɔ koo ndɛ bakondo ena e mboka, aliko la botala, aliko ike asamba bako baimi bɔɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Baeki bande bauchisa: «Ende ebaema ekambwa ɛndesha banɛ banto, anɛ aleiso oosowe?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu abaumboli: «Ole nyo la bitumbula binga?» Bauchisa «Esamnbaele».<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Laango Yesu aɔyisa banto luusa la njala anyɔi. Lonkinɛ ombo kemela bengo bitumbula esambaele, oke nsakoya Kanamombe. Lonkinɛ aeteni la abaɔyisa baeki bande o mbwaphakela bako lalikuli. Ŋango nde baiki kako. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Baiki lonkinɛ la tose tɔnchɛ. Yesu o sakoisa Kanamombe lonkinɛ aliko la ingo nse la nɔnda o baeki bande ba phakele lonkinɛ banto. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Kila onto ale o jiimbi jande. Baeki bakɔngi biphaka esambaele fua, la biteni bechikali. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Laango kaiki nde ilango banto elefu inɛi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:9">Lonkinɛ Yesu aalaki, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Kako nkango Yesu auleli e kyombo la baeki bande la achwe e booni ba Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafalisayɔ bambɔɔlɔmba Yesu aakɛɛlɛ ɛntɔmpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafalisayɔ baiyisa la manja toamo la Yesu aliko la mbowaambela lilonga. Baɔlɔmbi aɛnya imbali ɛmɔɔ e ɛtɔmpɔ ɛmɛnya iya nkulu yande yaimi ele Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu aomali, asebalali la nɔnda ike: «Aliko laanke banto ba lɛlɔ batalɔmbɛ imbali ya bɛtɔmpɔ? Mbokosimela nyo kolende sɔlɔ: Koo imbali ya ɛna nyo»!<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aachiki, la auleli e Kyombo la nsaphwa boleka bɔnkinɛ ba eliya.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isɔŋanya ya Mafalisayɔ la Elɔde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Baeki bande baopheli nkemela bitumbula bɛ lɔkɛndɔ, baiki nde la bɔmɔɔ opholi o kyombo. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Ayeka! Wiilende nyo la isɔŋanya ya Mafalisayɔ la ya Elɔde».<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Baeki baiki o toamo asamba bako: «Ɔlɔndi ŋango aliko bataika la bitumbula».<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu aeyi bingo baiki ako batalɔndɛ, aliko la ingo aasimeli: «Aliko laanke eta amoyana nyo nte apha nyo la bitumbula? Otaoke nyo lonkinɛ? Otaeye nyo? Basolo banyo balokonde baolo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Olende nyo la baiso la phaɛni nyo? Olende nyo la baatoi la phaoke nyo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:18">«Pha kanya nyo lonkinɛ <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />nte ango ateni lemi bitumbula bitano aliko la ndesha baanto ɛlɛfu itano? Biphaka inga biojisa nyo la bingo biteni bi kongi nyo» Bauchisa: «Joomu la iphee.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Obaumboli lonkinɛ: «Ango ateni lemi bitumbula esambaele aliko la mphaka o waanto ɛlɛfu inɛi, biphaka binga biojisa nyo la bitɛni bekongi nyo?» Bauchisa «Esambaele» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Laango Yesu obaumboli: «Otaeyaka nyo»?<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bontongo ba Bɛtɛsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ango Yesu la baeki bande baiyisa ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Bɛtɛsaida, banto baelisa bontongo ɔmɔɔ ele Yesu la mboosɛya aokobole. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akemeli ongo bontongo o likasa, la mbɔɔtɔla aanja ba ɔsɛngɛ. Lonkinɛ, oochweli chweli lɔsɔi o baisɔ, la mboo kicheya bakasa la owuumboli: «Ɔmwɛna ekambwa ɛmɔɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Bontongo asakoli baisɔ la nɔnda: «Mwɛna banto, kinaki mbobaɛna wɛɛnte bete beta kɛndɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu akichisa lonkinɛ bakasa aliko la baisɔ ba ongo onto; la ongo onto aiki, la mɛna bikambwa lailkuli phololo. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Laango Yesu aosimeli achu lande elulu, la: «Kuutolake lonkinɛ ɔɔsɛngɛ».<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɛ ombo lɔnda nte Yesu olende Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Pa ango, Yesu la baeki* bande ba pasi ango kaama. Bachwe ɔɔsɛngɛ bole sukɛlɛ la bɔsɛngɛ ba Kaisaliya Filipi. Ango baiki e mboka, Yesu aumboli o baeki bande: «Banto batalɔndɛ nte lemi n'nde nani?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bawuuchisa: «Bamɔɔ balɔndi nte olende Yɔani oso mbatisa, bankinɛ nte olende Eliya, bankinɛ lonkinɛ olende ɔmɔɔ a Baɛni».<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu obaumboli lonkinɛ: «La nyo atalɔndɛ nyo nte lemi n'nde nani?» Pɛtɛlɛ awuuchisa: «Wɛɛ kole Yesu Kilisito*.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Laango Yesu aalaki la membeleya nte batalɔndake la onto bengo besako.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo lɔnda aliko la mbwa la ntondwa yande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Pa Yesu ombwikicha ataekya baeki* bande: «Lemi Bɔna a Onto, kasana m'mba toakola ike; bekongo be Bayuda la bɛkɔta be baeta atei la baeikisi ba isaliya bakondo nkila. Lonkinɛ bakondo njakya, kinaki luina la isato ntondwaki.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu aasimeli baeki bande ingo lalikuli phololo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:32">Aliko la ingo, Pɛtɛlɛ oweeleli wiimongya la manja mboophangwela atalɔndake ŋango. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kinaki Yesu atulwe la nenda baeki bande*. Aphangweli Pɛtɛlɛ la mboosimela: «Wɛɛ bosombo pasa o baisɔ bami. Aliko bingo bitalɔndɛ wɛɛ, pheetaime ele Kanamombe kinaki ele banto.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Lonkinɛ Yesu aeleli boloi la baeki* bande la mbwasimela: «Iya ɔmɔɔ alangake liningita, asanjiya mbwikanya nɛmɛlɛ aɛmbɛ balemba bande la aningite. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Aliko ɔnɛ atalange mbikya luiko lande nɛmɛlɛ akondo limeya. Kinaki ɔnɛ alimɛya luiko lande aliko lami la aliko la besao be Kanamombe ndako akondo baaka lonkinɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Onde, kole la bekulu kulu nke onto mba bikambwa be wooni lalikuli, la nimeya luiko lande? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ao bonto aɔsɔna mpasha nke aliko la nsomba luiko lande?<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />«Eya nyo nte banto ba lɛlɔ banto ba njambi la lonkinɛ phaa lange Kanamombe. Aliko la ingo iya onto ole la nsɔni aliko lami la besao bemi otamboka ba anto, la lemi Bɔna a Onto ŋango ako njalaki la nsɔni la ndako, ango autolaki lemi la bephongo bɛɛlɔ ookuchu ba isɛmi».<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu amemisa mbwasimela lonkinɛ: «Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ, bamɔɔ banto waanɛ bale anɛ phaasane mbwa otamboka koo mɛna ekeleka e Kanamombe* manda la nkulu».<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotulola yiima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Biina besamalo paa, Yesu akemeli Pɛtɛlɛ la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani, auleli la bako eliko la bɔɔkɔ botale, eiki bako amɛlɛ. Engo Yesu aengoli yiima otamboka laako. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Bisenda bende biandi biɛlɔ pɛ. Koo onto e wooni lalikuli ɔnɛ aɛja ŋango. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kako nkango, bango Baeki* baɛni Eliya la Musa baombɔlaki la Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5-6" />Pɛtɛlɛ la baina lande phaiki la ja nɔnda aliko baiki la bɔɔma. Laango Pɛtɛlɛ aosimeli Yesu: «Weekisi, kolende bɔlɔti toyale anɛ. Tophike balɔmbɛ basato: Lilɔmbɛ limɔɔ jabɛ, linkinɛ ja Musa la linkinɛ ja Eliya».<verse eid="MRK 9:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Pa ango, loonge lɔmɔɔ laandi la mbwalipha la joi limɔɔ like mbokama: «Ɔnɛ kole Bɔna ami alanga lemi, owooke nyo ndako»!<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Kako nkango, bango baeki* balendi lonkinɛ, kinaki koo mɛna banto, Yesu nɛmɛlɛ wiiki la bako.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ango akitelaki bako bɔɔkɔ, Yesu aasimbi: «Batalɔndake la onto bingo biɛni bako, nende ango lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo tondwa».<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Baeki* bakɔwi koo nɔnda ekambwa, kinaki, bake bataumbolana asamba bako: «Atalange nɔnda nke aliko la ntondwa»?<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baeki bamboumbola Yesu aliko la manda ya Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Lonkinɛ baeki* ba Yesu ba wuumboli: «Aliko laanke baekisi ba Isaliya* balɔndi nte kasana Eliya aande obii?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu abauchisa: «Eliya akonwanda obi aliko la mbucha lalikuli wiisaliya. Kinaki aliko laanke lɔɔsi lataimɛya lonkinɛ nte Bɔna a Onto akondoba toakola ike la bakondo weelɔlela? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Lemi mbokosimela nyo: Eliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛliya aikinde wɛɛni otango o waanto Baayuda. Bayuda baiki batakanya nte Eliya akondo utola aliko la nsimela banto bailɔngɔsɔlɛ aliko la manda ya Bokakoli abɔ. Kinaki, Ɛliya ɔnɛ atalɔndɛ Yesu anɛ ko Yɔani oso mbatisa.</char></note> ombosila manda, kinaki banto baɔkɛɛ ŋango balangi bako, solo la ŋango balɔndi Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ aliko lande».<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwikya bɔna ole la basombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ango Yesu la baeki* bande basato aimaki bako e bɔɔkɔ, baiyisa mɛ la baeki* ba Yesu bankinɛ batikali, batani bango baeki* bankinɛ batikali, bambo lɛngama la boloi bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ baanto aliko baiki bata amoyana la Baekisi ba Isaliya*. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ango bango banto baɛni Yesus, basebalali bako lalikuli, la bachwe loango mbɔwɛɛbɛya.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu aumboli baeki* bande: «Nke ataamoyana nyo laanɛ banto?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Kinaki bonto ɔmɔɔ asamba boloi abuchisa: «Weekisi, nkwɛlisa bɔna ami, aliko ombo luana la bosombo ɔmɔɔ bobe, la bongo bosombo bombo okicha eluma. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Bosombo bata okemela kaama lalikuli, atabooke anyɔi, bɔna atapase lɔfulɔ woonywa. Lonkinɛ nkɛkɛtanya bainyo, la bionge nsenetala. La, lɔmbi ele baeki* babɛ baite bongo bosombo, kinaki koo mbɔsɔna»!<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu aasimeli: «Nyo banto ba lɛlɔ apha nyo la lokani! Biina benga, lonkinɛ beyala lemi lanyo? Eleko enga lonkinɛ esana lemi nkɔɛmba nyo? Oweela nyo ongo bɔna»!<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bawɛɛlisa, ango bosombo aɛni Yesu, oke mbɔɔ sɔkyasɔkya bɔna lankulu; la mbɔɔkwɛɛya e lɔmɔtu, oke mbeleŋanambeleŋana la mpasa lɔfulɔ woonya.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu aumboli isɛnde la bɔna: «Ndeka biina inga bimbo wiiyela binɛ?» La isɛnde auchisa: «Manja wɔɔkɛnda bande. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />La kila wiina ɔnɛ bosombo, mbo wookaka wiiya la wiiloko mona nte aojake. Iya alanga otookele ŋandi la waande ntokakola»!<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu awuuchisa: «Aliko laanke ombo lɔnda nyo nte iya aɔsɔna, lalikuli besana ele ongo ole la lokani.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Kako nkango, Isɛnde la bɔna aokomi: «Mbwimeya, kinaki omamole lokani lami lokokyame».<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu mɛna boloi baanto manda mɛ laako; laango, aphangweli bosombo bobe la mboosimela: «Wɛɛ bosombo eluma la epokoto: Pasa ele ɔnɛ bɔna la kuutolake lonkinɛ jɛ ele ndako»! <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Bongo bosombo aokomi, la nsɔkya bɔna la nkulu, la mpasa. Ongo bɔna wɛɛnamwi wɛɛnte bojo, banto ike baanjisa nɔnda nte: «Ombo bwa». <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kinaki Yesu aokemeli o likasa, oke mbowemaya la bɔna aemali.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ango Yesu autoli e lulu la baeki* bande baiki bako amɛlɛ la ndako, ba wuumboli: «Aliko laanke totaɔsɔna mbita ongo bosombo?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />La Yesu abauchisa: «Mbo nɔmba ntoo ya ɔsɔna mbita ongo bolengo ba osombo».<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo lɔnda lonkinɛ aliko la mbwa la ntondwa yande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu la baeki* bande ba pasi ango la nsaphwa e booni ba Galilaya. Kinaki Yesu koo nanga banto baeye engo eiki bako, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />aliko aiki ataekya baeki* bande la nɔnda: «Lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo phakemaka waakasa baanto, banɛ bako ndo njaka; kinaki, o biina isato, lakondo tondwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kinaki, baeki* bande koo mbeya bengo besao, la baiki la wɔɔma ombo wuumbola.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani ole waiyolo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesu la baeki* bande baiyisa ɔɔsɛngɛ ba Kapɛlɛmaumu. Ango aiki ndako e lulu, Yesu aumboli baeki* bande: «Nke eamoyanaki nyo e mboka?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kinaki bakowi, aliko, e mboka, baiki bata amoyana asamba bako aliko la mbeya nani ole waiyolo asamba bako.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Laango Yesu oyali anyɔi, aeleli baeki* bande joomu laaphee la mbwasimela: «Iya ɔmɔɔ alangake njala otamboka, aɔsɔna mbwikicha a kantunda baako lalikuli la bokambi baako lalikuli».<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Lonkinɛ akemeli yana ya likɛnda la mbookicha asamba bako; awemalisa la mbokombesanya waakasa bande la mbwasimela: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Ɔnɛ aɛbɛya bɔna ɔmɔɔ phoke ɔnɛ elokombo lami, ɔmɔ mbɛbɛya lemi nɛmɛlɛ; la ɔnɛ ambɛbɛya lemi, pha mbɛbisa lemi otoo, kinaki ombo ɛbɛya ɔnɛ antomi».<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnɛ apha boleka ɔnkinɛ olende boleka aso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yɔani asimeli Yesu: «Weekisi, tɔɛni bonto ɔmɔɔ aitaki basombo babe, e lokombo labɛ, kinaki taoni mboosimba, aliko apha wooloi baso».<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Kinaki Yesu obauchisa: «Ko simbake nyo lonkinɛ, aliko koo onto aɔsɔna nkɛɛ ɛntɔmpɔ ɛmɔɔ o lokombo lami, la phaɔsɔna lonkinɛ nɔnda bobe aliko lami. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Aliko ɔnɛ ole apha etamba eso, ko nɔnda ole nde boleka baso. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ, ɔnɛ akɔyaka bokoyo bɔmɔɔ ba iloko aliko ole nyo ele Kilisito*, Kanamombe* akondo ɔngɛla.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitakani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Ɔnɛ akwɛya e njambi ɔmɔɔ waanɛ bana bambo mimeya lemi, kasana bɔlɔti ele ndako baɔlɛmɛ libwɛ limɔɔ linɛnɛ e nkingo la mbowooka otema ba wango.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />«Iya likasa jabe limbo kokwɛɛya e njambi tena jako; bɔlɔti ele wɛɛ mingela e luiko la likasa limɔɔ kuliko nkombelela bakasa bako baphee la nchwa wiiya, wiiya ile phayalime. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Engo, bɛnsɔ bɛtale bionge bile pheebwaki, la iya ile phayalimaki jɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />La iya lokolo labɛ lombo kokwɛɛya e njambi, tena lako; aliko kasana bɔlɔti ele wɛɛ mingela e luiko la lokolo lɔmɔɔ kuliko nkombelela bekolo beko bephee la nphupholama wiiya. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Engo, bɛnsɔ betale bionge bile pheebwaki la iya ile phayalime jɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Lonkinɛ, iya lisɔ jabɛ limbo kokwɛɛya e njambi, phikola jako; aliko kasana bɔlɔti e wɛɛ mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe* la lisɔ limɔɔ kuliko nkombelela baiso bako baphee la nphupholama wiiya. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Engo, bɛnsɔ betale bionge bile pheebwaki la iya, la iya ile phayalime jɛ.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />«Aliko, kila onto akondo etelaka e toakola taiya ango akondo yala phoke lɛɛphɔ lɔmɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ango bana ba Isilaeli baiki batapasha mpato ya lilɛ ele Kanamombe*. Baiki bata ile lɛɛphɔ. Ɔsɔmɛ: Balawi 2. 13. </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Lɛɛpho loyalaka nde ekambwa ɛmɔɔ ɛlɔti; kinaki iya lolimeyake lɔɛja lande, ŋaande aɔsɔna nyo mbucha lɔɛja? Yala nyo la lɛɛphɔ ele nyo amɛlɛ la oyale nyo bii bamɔɔ la bankinɛ».<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Isaliya aliko la maŋana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu apasi ango la nchwa e wooni ba Yudɛya, nende boleka onkinɛ ba losi ba Yɔlɔdani. Boloi bɔmɔɔ baanto bosaŋani lonkinɛ mɛ landako la oke manja mbobaekya, ŋango akɛisa ndako biina lalikuli.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Lonkinɛ, Bafalisayɔ bamɔɔ ba sukami sukɛlɛ la Yesu aliko la mbo waambela lilonga. Bawuumboli: «Isaliya yaso imbolɔnda nte mpame ombo koka mbita waajande»?<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu obauchisa wiingo mumbola yaɔ: «Isaliya nke yakochikeli nyo Musa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bake nɔnda: «Musa atosimeli nte, mpame aonake mbita waajande awaandikele balowa ba maŋana la mbowiita».<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu aasimeli: «Musa akwandikeli nyo ingo isaliya, aliko la basolo banyo nkulu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kinaki, katango Kanamombe aombi bikambwa lalikuli, la aombi mpame la wainto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Otango 1. 27; 5.2</char></note>» <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Aliko laingo, mpame akondotika isɛnde la nyaŋɛndɛ la njala kaama kamɔɔ la waajande. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />La bako ba phee bakondoyalaka bionge bimɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Otango 2.24</char></note>. Lonkinɛ bachiki baphee kinaki bionge bimɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Nte ingo eoŋanisha Kanamombe kotayalake bonto aɔsɔna maŋanya.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ango aiki baeki* otema ba lulu, bauumboli lonkinɛ ele Yesu weengo besao. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu abauchisa: «Iya mpame ombwita waajande la nsɔnga onkinɛ, ombo kɛɛ litola ele ongo aotamboka; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ŋango ako, iya wainto ombo pasa ele bome ande, la nsɔngwa la onkinɛ bome, ombo kɛɛ litola ele ongo bome ande otango.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo chwela bana bochwako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Luina lɔmɔɔ, banto bawɛɛlisa Yesu bana aliko la mbwaapheya bakasa, kinaki baeki* bake mbwa phangwela. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ango aɛni Yesu ingo, oke momala nkɛlɛ la nɔnda la baeki bande: «Lɛla bana baande kami! Kota asimbake nyo, aliko la ekeleka e Kanamombe* kelende ele banɛ bale phoke bako. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Mbokosimela nyo, kolende sɔlɔ: Ɔnɛ ole phaimiya besao be ekeleka e Kanamombe* phoke bɔna, phaɔsɔna jɛ mingela kako.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu aakombesanyi bana, aachweli bochwako ombo baapheya bakasa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bonto boso nombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ango Yesu aanjisa lonkinɛ lɔkɛndɔ, bonto ɔmɔɔ aandi loango la mbwi yoka la nkɔma balwe otamboka lande la mbowuumbola: «Weekisi bɔlɔti, lemi nkɛɛ ŋaande aliko lamba luiko la tiiti»?<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu aosimeli: «Aliko laanke emombelela wɛɛ bɔlɔti? Koo bonto ole bɔlɔti ila Kanamombe nɛmɛlɛ! <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ombweya ŋango isaliya ilɔndaka: ‹Kojakake, Kokɛɛkɛ litola; Mbiya; Usuula ba bolimbo, Kolɔndake bolimbo; ila kucha isɛɛ la nyɛŋɛɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Mpasa 20.12-16; Kumbukumbu 5.16-20</char></note>›» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ongo bonto obuchisa: «Weekisi, nkɛɛka bingo lalikuli oomponjo bami.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu aolendi la baiso ba nanga, la aosimeli: «Kombokopheka ekambwa ɛmɔɔ, chwaka nsombya lalikuli bile wɛɛ la bɛko, la mbɔya baso boola bengo ombwikicheya bokombe e loola, lonkinɛ aka oningite lemi».<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Kinaki ango aoki ongo bompojo bingo, alɛmi ɛlongi la achwe ataomala, aliko wiiki la besanga ike. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu alendi baeki* bande, baiki bata otimbe la mbwasimela: «Kolende koolo ele baso nombo mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe»!<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Baeki* bake nsebalala la bosao bande. Kinaki Yesu aasimeli lonkinɛ: «Bana ami, kolende koolo mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe*! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kolende koolo o ngamia mingela e mpuku e nsingɛ, kinaki kolende koolo lonkinɛ boso nombo mingela weekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Baeki* ba Yesu baoki lonkinɛ ingo basebalali, la mumbolana bamɔɔ la bankinɛ iya ŋaanɛ: «Nani lonkinɛ okakolamaki»?<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu oalendi la aasimeli: «Kolende nkulu ele banto, kinaki jɛ ele Kanamombe, aliko lalikuli bimbosana ele ndako».<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pɛtɛlɛ aosimeli: «Oka, totiki beko lalikuli aliko la nkolingita.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu abuuchisa: «Mbokosimela nyo kolende sɔlɔ: iya bonto ombo tika lulu lande, ao baotwa lande la batamba bande la nyɛŋɛnde la bana ande la bibeli bende, aliko lami la besao be Kanamombe*, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />Obaaki mala miya weeleko ɛnɛ etayale iso nkaanɛ: akondoba mbulu, baotwa, betamba, ba lele, bana la bibeli. Koonga ŋango akondo baaka twakola aliko lami. La luina loandaki, akondo baaka luiko ba tiiti. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kinaki ike banɛ bale otamboka asamba nyo lɛlɔ, bakondoyalaka ɔɔkɔngɔ. La banɛ bale ɔɔkɔngɔ bakondoyaka otamboka».<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolɔnda mala e isato aliko la libwelo la ntondwa yande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ango aiki Yesu la Baeki* bande e mboka e nchwa Yɛlusalɛma, Yesu aiki atakɛndɛ otamboka la bako, baeki baiki batasebalala la bango baolingitaki baiki la wɔɔma. Yesu okemeli lonkinɛ baeki* bande joomu la aphee la njala ataasimela bingo bi wiiyelaki. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />La Yesu aasimeli: «Oka nyo, tombuulela e Yɛlusalɛma, engo lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo phakemaka ele bakɛndi* la Baekisi ba isaliya. La bako, bakondo mphaka waapakano aliko la linjaka. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Banɛ bakondo mbelolelaka, bakondo nchwela lɔsɔi, bakondo mphola behapho la linjaka. Kinaki, e biina isato, lakondo tondwaka».<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nɔmba ya Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Lonkinɛ, bana ba phee ba Sɛbɛdayɔ, Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani baandi ele Yesu la mboosimela: «Weekisi, tombolanga oto kɛɛlɛ bingo bikɔlɔmba iso.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu abaumboli: «Atalange nko kɛɛlɛ nyo nke?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bawuuchisa: «Ango ayalaka wɛɛ weeje ɛbɛ eukuchu, ɔtɔya iso kaama ka njala boleka abɛ, ɔmɔɔ boleka ba loome labɛ la onkinɛ e loali labɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Kinaki Yesu aasimeli: «Phaeye nyo binɛ bitalɔmbɛ nyo, aɔsɔna nyo nywa bokoyo ba twakola bɔnɛ baona lemi nywa? Ao aba lemi ubatiso ba twakola lanyo aɔsɔna mbatisiwa ŋango?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />La bawuuchisa: «Taɔsɔna.» Yesu aasimeli: «Kolende sɔlɔ: Akondonywa nyo bokoyo bɔnɛ baona lemi nywa ba toakola la ubatiso ba toakola yaba lemi akondobaaka nyo ŋango ako. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kinaki, kapha lemi kaasɔna mpanga ɔnɛ asɛlɛlaka e loome lami la loali lami; kango kaama kalende ele bango Kanamombe pa mbwakicheya.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ango aoki bango bankinɛ baeki* joomu bingo, baomali nkɛlɛ aliko la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu aeleli Baeki* bande lalikuli la mbwasimela: «Ombweya nyo nte, bango bataɛni nyo phoke Bɛkɔta be anto bataakonja la nkulu, la banɛ bale wiijee batabaɛnya twakola. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kinaki, ingo phayayale lonkinɛ asamba nyo. Aliko, iya ɔmɔɔ anyo alangake njala waiyolo, kasana ayale bokambi anyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />La iya ɔmɔɔ anyo alangake njala otamboka la nyo, aɔsɔna njala bɔkwɛɛ* baanto lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Aliko lemi Bɔna a Onto, koo manda aliko la mbwikambela, kinaki, laandi nde nkambelana la mpaka luiko lami aliko la nkakola baanto ike.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo wiikya bontongo Balatimayɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu la Baeki* bande baiyisa wɔɔsɛngɛ ba Yɛliko. Apasi bako woongo ɔsɛngɛ, boloi bɔmɔɔ baanto baalingiti. Bonto ɔmɔɔ aiki ontongo ataelelama Balatimayɔ, bɔna a Time, aiki atasɛlɛla e mpamba la mboka la nɔmbanɔmba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ango aoki ndako nte olende Yesu a Nasalɛti kataete, oke mbwikicha ataokoma la nɔnda: «Yesu Bɔna a Daudi, ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Banto ike baophangwelaki nte akɔwɛ, kinaki, aphaphi lonkinɛ mbokoma la nkulu: «Bɔna a Daudi ɔmɛnɛlɛ ŋandi»!<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Aliko la ingo, Yesu aemali la nɔnda: «Elela nyo ndako.» Baeleli lonkinɛ ongo ontongo la mboosimela: «Kekemala, emala wɛɛ, ombo koelela.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Aoki ndako ŋamgo, kako nkango o phunbwe loango aphupholi esenda ende, la nchwela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu awuumboli: «Nke elanga wɛɛ nko kɛɛlɛ» ontongo owuuchisa: «Weekisi, kɛɛ nte m'mɛni lonkinɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />La Yesu aosimeli: «Chwaka, lokani labɛ lombo koikya.» Kako nkango, ɔɛni lonkinɛ, la oolingiti Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Mingela ya Yesu e Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ango asukami Yesu la Baeki* bande sukɛlɛ la wooni ba Yɛlusalɛma, baiye sukɛlɛ la bɛsɛngɛ be Bɛtɛfage la Bɛtaniya, sukɛlɛ la bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni. Yesu otomi otamboka ba phee ba Baeki* bande. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Aasimeli: «Chwaka nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ bole engo otamboka lanyo. Ango, aiya nyo akondo tana nyo bɔna a punda ombo lɛmama, ɔnɛ atayalelama la onto. Lɛmɔla nyo ndako, la ombela nyo lemi. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Iya onto akuumbolake nyo, aliko laanke ɔmbɔ kɛɛ nyo ŋango, simela nyo ndako: ‹Bɔkɔta kombo weelela, kinaki, akondo wuuchaka kako nkaanɛ›».<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bango Baeki* bachwe la batani ongo bɔna a mpunda ombo lɛmama mpamba la mboka. Baanjisa mbɔɔlɛmɔla, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />banto bamɔɔ baiki ango ba baumboli: «Haɔɔ! Nke etakɛɛ nyo? Aliko laanke ɛmbɔ lɛmɔla nyo ɛnɛ mpunda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Baeki* ba bauchisa bingo bilɔndi Yɛsu, la bako baasanjisa bachu.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Baeki* bawɛɛlisa Yesu mpunda; bakichisa bisɛnda bɛɔ eliko la mpunda, la Yesu asɛlɛli eliko lande. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Banto ike baanjisa bisɛnda bɛɔ e mboka, la bankinɛ bakichaki bitaphe beete bitenaki bako wiibeli. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bango bachwaki otamboka la Yesu, la bango baandaki ɔkɔngɔ baokomaki:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«Osana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsana: O Kiebalaniya ko nɔnda ''Otokakole nkaanɛ''. Ɔsɔmɛ: Sabuli 86.2; Yɛlɛmiya 31.7 </char></note>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Akuchame ɔnɛ ataande e lokombo la Bɔkɔta*!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 118.25-26.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />La Kanamombe* aachwele bochwako eekeleka e nkɛso Daudi etaande.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Kanamombe* akuchame e loola»!<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Pa ango, Yesu wiingeli e Yɛlusalɛma. La mingela e lulu la Kanamombe*, pa nsila nenda lalikuli, aliko ango kaiki nde koke likɔlɔ. Ochwe e Bɛtaniya la Baeki* bande joomu la baphee.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo kɔmɛla bote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Wiina onkinɛ, Yesu la Baeki* bande aimaki bako e Bɛtaniya Yesu aoki botala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aɛni bɔɔ bote bɔmɔɔ ba mutini, la ochwe nenda iya atana biuma. Kinaki, ango aiki ndako sukɛlɛ la ongo bote otani ntiti ntoo. Aliko kotaika eleko ende e mbota biuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Laango Yesu akɔmɛli bongo bote la nɔnda: «Manja lɛlɔ, koo onto alɛɛ lonkinɛ jɛ biuma bɛbɛ!» La baeki bawookaki.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombwita basombisi e lulu la Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesu la Baeki* bande pa mingela e Yɛlusalɛma. Yesu aingeli e lulu la Kanamombe*. Aiti banɛ ba sɔmbyaki la bango ba sombaki otema ba lulu la Kanamombe*. Okukumisa mesa ya baengoli ba besanga, la bijee ya baso nsɔmbya bilenga. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />La koo ntika bonto aembɛ ekambwa e lulu la Kanamombe*.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus chasse les marchands dans le Temple" file="WA03896b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="11.16">Yesu ombwita basombisi e lulu la Kanamombe</figure><verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu aanjisa mbo baekya ŋaanɛ: Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ lɔ lɔndaka nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">«Lulu lami lakondo elelamaka lulu la nɔmba o waanto lalikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Isaya 56.7. Nyo ombotulola nyo bokombe baakumoli. </char></note>. Kinaki nyo, ambosilaka nyo ntulola lulu la mbisama la baiyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Yɛlɛmiya 7. 11</char></note>»!<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Pa ango, Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* la baekisi ba Isaliya* baoki bingo la baonaki bolengo ba mona mboojakya Yesu. Kinaki, baiki la wɔɔma lande, aliko banto ike basebalalaki o mbekya yande. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ango aiki kako likɔlɔ, Yesu la Baeki* bande bapasi woongo ɔsɛngɛ.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lokani la Maɔmbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />La mpendu kɛmɛlɛ, Yesu la Baeki* bande, o mbeta e mboka, baɛni bongo bote ba mutini bomooma nende weejo. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Laango, Pɛtɛlɛ okanyisa bingo Yesu akɔmɛli bongo bote la mboosimela: «Weekisi, lenda! Bote bo mutini bokɔmɛli wɛɛ bo mooma lalikuli».<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Laango Yesu ɔlɔndi la Baeki* bande: «Yala nyo la lokani ele Kanamombe*! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ, bonto aɔsɔna nɔnda la okondi: ‹Phikwa la wiyoke o wango.› La iya apha la mashaka e lisolo jande, kinaki, aimeyake nte bilɔndi ndako biiyaki, bikondo wiyelaka. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Aliko laingo, mbokosimela nyo: ango atalɔmbɛ nyo ele Kanamombe*, aliko la ɛkambwa ɛmɔɔ, imeya nyo nte ombosila nyo keba, la ango akondo ɔyama.<verse eid="MRK 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />«La ango ayala nyo atalɔmbe Kanamombe*, la ole nyo la bosao la onto ɔmɔɔ, sokola nyo obi. Lonkinɛ nte isɛ nyo, ole e loola akosokolele nyo bobe bokɛisa nyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[La iya phosokoleli nyo bankinɛ, isɛ nyo ole e loola phaɔsɔna nkosokolela nyo lonkinɛ bobe bongo bokɛisa nyo»].<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ende emwima nkulu ya Yesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu la Baeki* bande baiyisa lonkinɛ o wooni ba Yɛlusalɛma. Ango Yesu aiki atakɛndɛ e lulu la Kanamombe*, Bɛkɔta be Bakɛndi la Baekisi ba Isaliya* la Bekongo Beayuda* baosukameli. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bawuumboli: «E nkulu nke itakɛɛ wɛɛ binɛ bikambwa? Nani akɔyisa luusa la nkɛɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu obauchisa: «Lami laona kuumbola nyo ekambwa ɛmɔɔ, iya ombucheyake nyo. Laango, la kondo kosimela nyo o nkulu nke yatakee lemi binɛ bikambwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Luusa la ubatiso ba Yɔani baimi nde ele Kanamombe* ao o wanto? Ombucheya nyo».<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bango Bekongo baingeli yuungu bako amɛlɛ. Basimelani: «Iya tobuucheyake nte Kanamombe* ka wɔɔyisa luusa, akondo tuumbola: ‹Aliko laanke nyo, koo mbo wiimeya?› <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />La iya tobuucheyake nte banto ba wɔɔyisa luusa, banto bakondo toomalela.» Bango Bɛkɔta balɔndi ŋango aliko baiki batalawa banto, aliko banto lalikuli, baiki bataeye nte Yɔani aiki nde sɔlɔ wɛɛni*. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Laango, bauchisa Yesu: «Iso phata eye.» La Yesu abauchisa: «Lemi, phalata kosimɛla nyo e nkulu nke yatakee lemi bingo lalikuli».<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Jɔmbɔ ja bakambi babe ba bibeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu aanjisa mbekya banto weemanu. Alɔndi: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ aoni ebeli e Misabibu*. Alilingi la likula, atimi liphuku aliko la mamola Misabibu, ophiki lilɔmbɛ ja liko ya bachungi aliko la nkenga Misabibu*. Ochikeli bakambi ba mbɔɔngɛla la ochwe e wooni ba bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Weeleko ba mbuka, ongo oso ebeli, otomi bokambi ɔmɔɔ ele bango bakambi aliko la mbɔwɔya bende Misabibu*. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kinaki, bango bakambi baokemeli la baophomi la mbowuucha bakasa phololo. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Laango otomi onkinɛ bokambi, ongo onkinɛ, baophomi ɔɔtɛ la mbo weelolela. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ongo ɔmɛlɛ ebeli otomi lonkinɛ onkinɛ bonto, ongo, baojaki. La aatomeli lonkinɛ bankinɛ ike ŋango ako: baaphomi bamɔɔ la bajaki bankinɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />«Ongo omɛlɛ ebeli, otikali la bɔna ɔmɔɔ otoo aiki ngoli ende. Aotomi e kantunda, aliko okanisa nte, bakondo okucha.<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />«Kinaki, bango bakambi ba wɛɛni, bake nɔnjana asamba bako: ‹Ɔnɛ kole mpɛnɛ! Toojake aliko bɔmpɛnɛ bakondo yala baso!› <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Baokemeli ongo bɔna, baojaki la baphupholi bojo bande anja la ebeli.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />«Laango, nke ɛkɛɛ ɔmɛlɛ ebeli? Akonoandaka mbwa jaka bakambi lalikuli la mphaka ebeli waankinɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />«Asɔmi nyo kɛmɛlɛ bongo bosao e Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">«Libwe linɛ ja phupholami laaphiki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Limbotulwa libwe ja lokani la lulu.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Bɔkɔta ka kɛisa bongo bosao.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">La jako likende ja sebalala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sabuli 118.22-23</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bango Bɛkɔta Beayuda* baonaki bolengo ba nkemela Yesu. Aliko, baeyaki nte alɔndaki bongo bomanu aliko la bako. Kinaki, baiki la wɔɔma ba boloi. Baochiki la bachwe.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndipa kodi ele Kaisaliya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Bango Bɛkɔta Beayuda*, batomi ele Yesu ba Falisayɔ bamɔɔ la banto bamɔɔ boleka ba Elɔde. Aliko la mbo waambela lilonga wiingo bɛlɔnda ndako.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bɛkɔta Beayuda* baandi mbo wuumbola: «Weekisi, tombo eya nte ɔlɔndaka sɔlɔ apha la bɔɔma la bitakanya bankinɛ. La phalende biima bianto, kinaki, ataekya sɔlɔ ɔ lɔkɛndɔ latalange Kanamombe*. Lonkinɛ Otosimele: Isaliya yaso yalanga ndipa kodi ele Bɔkɔta ba Kaisaliya*? Taɔnɔla mbwilipa ao jɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kinaki, Yesu aeyi nte bandaisha bakani baɔ ba sɔlɔ; aasimeli: «Aliko laanke omo mambela nyo lilonga? Ombela nyo lemi likuti limɔɔ, aliko mbɔlɔɛni.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bawɛɛlisa lɔmɔɔ, la Yesu abaumboli: «Ɛnɛ yiima la lɔnɛ lokombo lole anɛ o linɛ likuti bile benani?» Bauchisa: «Be Bɔkɔta Kaisaliya».<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Laango Yesu aasimeli: «Ɔya nyo Bɔkɔta Kaisaliya bile bende, la Kanamombe bile be Kanamombe.» La bake nsebalala aliko la mbucheya ya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mumbola aliko la ntondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Pa, Basandukayɔ bamɔɔ baandi ele Yesu. Banɛ batalɔndaka nte babwe phaɔsɔna ntondwa lonkinɛ. Bawuumboli: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Weekisi, Musa aandiki wiisaliya* yaso nte: ‹Iya bonto ombo bwa koo mbota bɔna, kasana waankunɛ ande aɔsɛ ongo wainto ochikali aliko la mbotela boolo ande bana.› <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Laango, kaiki nde baotwa esambaele. Botango asɔngi la abwe koo mbota bɔna. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Amamana lande aosangoli bobwele la abwe koo mbota bana la ongo wainto; la aisato ŋango ako. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />La bako lalikuli esambaele babwe koo mbota la ongo wainto. Pa bako lalikuli mbwa, la wainto abwe ŋango ako. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Wiina ba tondwaka, ongo wainto ayala anani? Aliko, bako lalikuli esambaele baiki nde ba ome yande»!<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu aasimeli: «Ombwi ilimba nyo! Aliko phaeye nyo Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ la nkulu ya Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ango atondwaki babwe, ba mpame la bainto phaasɔnganaki, kinaki, bakondo yalaka phoke biphongo e loola. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Lonkinɛ, aliko la ntondwa yaabwe, nyo koo nsɔma jɛ libuku ja Musa, aliko la boliko ba towaki iya la koo nongola. Kanamombe aosimeli Musa nte: ‹Nende Kanamombe ka Ibulaimu la Kanamombe ka Isaka la Kanamombe ka Yakɔbɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mpasa 3.2,6</char></note>›». <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yesu ɔlɔndi lonkinɛ: «Kanamombe apha Kanamombe ka aso mbwa, kinaki, olende Kanamombe kaaso luiko! Ko nɔnda, atailimbe nyo»!<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaliya inɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Weekisi ɔmɔɔ ba Isaliya* abaoki bata amoyana la Yesu. Wɛɛni nte Yesu auchisa bɔlɔti ele bango Basandukayɔ*. Oosukameli la awuumboli: «Isaliya nke iyalaka inɛnɛ aliko la inkinɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu owuuchisa: «Ɛna Isaliya* ile inɛnɛ: ‹Oka, Isilaeli! Bɔkɔta Kanamombe aso oyalaka Kanamombe* ɔmɔɔ o too.› <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Aɔsɔna nanga Kanamombe* abɛ la lisolo jabɛ lalikuli, la limanya jabɛ lalikuli la nkulu yabɛ lalikuli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Kumbukumbu 6. 4-5</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />La isaliya ya iphee nko inɛ: ‹Yalaka atalange amamani la wɛɛ phoke wɛɛmɛlɛ.› Koo inkinɛ isaliya inɛnɛ aliko la ingo iphee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Balawi 19.18.</char></note>».<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />La ongo Weeksi ba Isaliya* ɔlɔndi la Yesu: «Bɔlɔti, weekisi! Ŋango bɔlɔndi wɛɛ kolende sɔlɔ. Kanamombe* olende ɔmɔɔ o too, la koo onkinɛ Kanamombe* phoke ndako. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Kila onto aɔsɔna nanga Kanamombe, la lisolo jande lalikuli, la limanya jande lalikuli la nkulu yande lalikuli. La aɔsɔna nanga amamani lande phoke nɛmɛlɛ. Ingo ilende bɔlɔti ndeka mpato* lalikuli e mbɔya Kanamombe* la ntumba nyama». <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu aɛni nte ongo weekisi auchisa la limanya, aosimeli: «Apha bɔɔ la ekeleka e Kanamombe*.» Pa ango, koo onto a kekeli lonkinɛ mbo wuumbola Yesu bosao.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito la Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Laango Yesu aiki ataekya e lulu la Kanamombe*, aumboli: «Namuna nke Baekisi ba Isaliya* batalɔndɛ nte Kilisito* olende bɔna a Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Aliko, Daudi nɛmɛlɛ aɛnyami la Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ, ɔlɔndi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">«Bɔkɔta Kanamombe alɔndi la Bɔkɔta aso:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Aka lokoyale e loome lami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Nende ango lakondo kicha bitamba bɛbɛ entina be baina baɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Sabuli 110. 1.</char></note>».<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />«Daudi nɛmɛlɛ alɔndaki nte Kilisito* olende Bɔkɔta ande. Namuna nke Kilisito* aɔsɔna njala lonkinɛ bɔna a Daudi»?</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu atalake banto lilako aliko la Baekisi ba Isaliya</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">La boloi bɔnɛnɛ baanto babookaki la libɛla. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu alɔndi e mbekya yande: «Ayekaka nyo! La Baekisi ba Isaliya* bango balangaka nkɛnda la nkajo ntale! La nanga mbɛbɛyama ya okuchu atiya ba beloi, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Lonkinɛ, balangaka njala wiijee beotamboka e Basaŋanelo*, lonkinɛ kaama ka libɛla balangaka njala wiijee beokuchu. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bakumolaka ele bebwele bikambwa lalikuli bile la bako, la kako nkango, batakɛɛ malɔmbi batale, aliko la mbeyama. Aliko la ingo, Kanamombe akondo asambisaka».<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpato e Obwele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Ango Yesu aiki atayale weeli la Sanduku e mpato*, aɛnaki ŋango banto bailaki mpato weengo Sanduku. Baso nombo ike bailaki bakuti ike otema ba Sanduku. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Bobwele ɔmɔɔ boola, aiyisa la mbila bakuti baphee ba mongo otema ba engo Sanduku, ingo ile phayaɔsɔna nsomba ekambwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Laango Yesu aeleli baeiki* bande la mbwasimela: «Mbokosimela nyo sɔlɔ: ɔnɛ obwele boola ndako kombopasha ike ele Kanamombe ndeka bankinɛ banto.» <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Aliko, bankinɛ lalikuli bapasisha ele Kanamombe totikalaki ta bakuti baɔ. Kinaki ndako, o boola bande apasisha lalikuli biiki ndako la beko aliko la luiko lande.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombɔ lɔnda aliko la mpanjolama ba lulu la Kanamombe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Laango Yesu wiiki atapase e lulu la Kanamombe*, ɔmɔɔ a Baeki* bande aosimeli: «Weekisi, ndaka! Babwe nke balɔti! Biphikeli nke binɛnɛ binɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu obuuchisa: «Ɔmwɛna biphikeli binɛ binɛnɛ? Phakatikalaki anɛ libwɛ limɔɔ aliko la linkinɛ, lalikuli yakondo mphanjolamaka»!<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tosoya la njakema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu asɛlɛlaki eliko la bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni*, boleka ba lulu la Kanamombe*. Pɛtɛlɛ la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani la Andele baotani ango la mbo wuumbola: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Otosimele: Eleko nke epaselaki bingo la imbali nke iyɛnyaki engo lalikuli biiyaki»?<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Laango Yesu waanji mbwaasimela: «Ayeka nyo! Bonto lalikuli atakolimbake nyo»!<verse eid="MRK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />«Aliko, banto ike baandaki e lokombo lami la balɔndaki: ‹Lemi kole Kilisito*!› La Bakondo limbaka banto ike. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Weengo biina, aokaka nyo banto batalɔndɛ aliko la lisɛ kaama lalikuli. Kinaki kolawake nyo, aliko kasana bingo lalikuli biiye. Kinaki kakondo yala kotaiye jɛ e kantunda ba wooni. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Banto bamɔɔ bakondo chwa njakyana la bankinɛ banto, la ekeleka ɛmɔɔ kekondo chwa njakyana la ekeleka enkinɛ. Lɔmɔtu yakondo sɔkaka kaama ike, la kakondo yala botala. Bingo lalikuli bekondoyalaka phoke belando betango be mbota».<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />«Kinaki nyo, ayeka nyo, nyo amɛlɛ. Aliko banto bakondo kɔtɔla nyo e tumilali; bakondo kophoma nyo o Basaŋanelo. Bakondo kɔtɔla nyo ele Bɛkɔta, bakondo kɔtɔla nyo ele Bɛkɔta be wooni, aliko lami, aliko la mbobaɛnya usuula bami otamboka baɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kinaki, kasana obi besako be Kanamombe* beekyame ele banto lalikuli.<verse eid="MRK 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />«La ango ayalaka bako batakotɔlɛ nyo otamboka ba tumilali, ko aŋangake nyo la mbuiyumbola: Nke ɛlɔnda iso. Kinaki lɔnda nyo besao bengo besimelaki nyo weengo eleko. La bengo besao pheepasaki kanyo, kinaki yatapase ele Lɔkɛngɛ Lɔɛlɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />«Aotwa la onto akondo ophakaka aotwa lande ajakeme, phapha akondo phaka bɔna ande ajakeme. Bana bakondo yalaka bitamba be baoti babɔ, la bakondo atɔla batande ba mbwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Banto lalikuli bakondo ko nina aliko la lemi, kinaki, ongo akinyaka nende ekantunda, akondo kakolama».<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Toakola tɔnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «O longo luina akondo ɛna nyo enino, la lɔfutɔ lomo emala kaama kale phakasane njala. Ɔnɛ lalikuli asɔma bene besao aeye bɔlɔti. Laango, bango bayalaka e wooni ke Yudeya balawe nchwa o bɛɔkɔ; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ongo atanemwaka eliko la nsambe e lulu, atakitelake lonkinɛ mbɔsa ekambwa otema ba lulu lande; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ongo atanemwaka weebeli ende atautolake lonkinɛ kande mbɔsa esenda ende. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Longo luina, lakondo yala ŋandi ele bainto baakundu la bango ba nɔmya! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Lɔmba nyo Kanamombe* aliko ingo itakuiyelake nyo weeleko ba mbula. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Aliko biina bengo, banto bakondo baaka toakola ike. Koo onto jɛ amwɛnaka toakola phoke tongo manja katango nende lɛlɔ. La koo onto aɛnaka lonkinɛ toakola phoke tongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Iya Bɔkɔta koo mumbeya biina bingo, koo onto aɔsɔna nkakolama. Kinaki, aumbeisa aliko la banto basɔni ndako.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />«Weengo eleko, iya bonto ɔmɔɔ akosimelake nyo: ‹Lenda! Kilisito* ole nde anɛ›! Aɔ alɔndake: ‹Lenda! Kilisito* olende eni›! Koo wimeyake nyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Aliko, banto ike ba elimbo bakondopasela la nɔnda: ‹Lemi ko Kilisito*›. La kakondo pasela Baɛni* baelimbo, bango lalikuli, bakondo kɛɛ bintɔmpɔ, aliko, iya kasana balimbe, koonga bango basɔni Kanamombe*. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Lonkinɛ nyo, ayeka nyo! Aliko Lemi la kɔɛphɔli nyo wiingo lalikuli otamboka la bianda»!<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutola ya Bɔna a Onto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Yesu olɔndi lonkinɛ: Weengo eleko, ɔɔkɔngɔ ba nkangi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">Yaani ya kondo tulwaka wiilima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">La ŋɔndɔ, phekepashaki lonkinɛ ekowa.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Tɔɔtɔ la tako, takondo kwaaka nkwaaka mina e loola.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">La, lalikuli ile la nkulu e loola bekondo sɔkaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Isaya 13.10; 34.4.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />«Laango, banto bakondo mɛna Lemi Bɔna a Onto latakitela nde atei ba longe, la nkulu ike la bokuchu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Lakondo tomaka biphongo* bemi o tokumba tako tɔnɛi ta booni aliko la saŋanya bango ba sɔni Lemi».<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jɔmbɔ ba bote ba mutini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «Wiiyekya nyo, mbetela jɔmbɔ ja bote ba mutini: Ango aɛnaka nyo bitaphi be ongo bote bata mɛnɛ, la ntiti yande yata tephatepha, eya nyo nte, eleko elɔchi kembosukama. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ŋango akɔ, ango aɛnaka nyo bingo bikambwa lalikuli bimboɛnamwa, eya nyo nte, Lemi Bɔna a Onto mbosukama. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Mbokosimela nyo, kolende sɔlɔ: banto ba lɛlɔ phaabwaki lalikuli otamboka ba ingo mbiya. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Loola la wooni bekondo eta, kinaki, besao bɛmi pheetaki jɛ».<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koo onto aeya luina laandaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Yesu alɔndi lonkinɛ: «Aliko la longo luina la eleko, bengo besao biiyaki, koo onto aeya: koonga biphongo be Kanamombe*, koonga Lemi Bɔna phalaeye. Phapha nɛmɛlɛ kaeya.»<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />«Ayeka nyo! Kolalake nyo. Aliko, phaeye nyo eleko eiyaka bingo lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kakondo yalaka phoke bonto ɔmɔɔ achwe ɛ lɔkɛndɔ. Oke ntika lulu lande waakambi bande. Ombo ɔya kila onto bolemo bande, la nsimela bochungi ba lɔkukɛ aliphole baiso.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />«Yala nyo baiso phololo, aliko, phaeye nyo wiina nke ɔmɛlɛ lulu wiiyaki. Kamɔɔ kaɔsɔna njala likɔlɔ ao asamba ilumu, ao ango aekaka nkɔkɔ ntango ao mpendu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Yala baiso phololo, atakuitolake nyo la nkotana nyo atalale. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Inɛ yatakosimela nyo Lemi, landasimela banto lalikuli: yala nyo baiso phololo»!<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Bɛkɔta bambo kɛɛ yuungu ya njaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Otamboka ba biina bephee, be libɛla be Pasaka* la libɛla be bitumbula koo bosunga buiye, Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* la Baekisi ba Isaliya* baoni mboka e nkemela Yesu la mbishamambishama aliko la mboojaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kinaki, balɔndaki nte: «Phakasane mbookemela e libɛla. Iya ŋango, banto bakondo ela bolupho».<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wainto ɔmɔɔ ombo suulela Yesu bauta ba limbala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu aiki e Betaniya, e lulu la Simoni boso nsuli. Ango aiki ndako atale, wainto ɔmɔɔ aiye, la lintumpa ya lɔngɔsɔlami la libwɛ ja alubati. Wiingo lintupa kwiki bauta ba lisɔmbi joolo. Bango bauta baiki batalɔngɔsɔlama la bolowa ba ote yata elelama Nalato, lonkinɛ, phayaiki yataluana la inkinɛ ekambwa. Pa, ongo wainto omboliphola linchumpa la nsuulela yesu bauta wɔɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Laango banto bamɔɔ waango baiki ango ba omali nkɛlɛ, batalɔnjana asamba bako: «Aliko laanke etaphute ndako bauta ba limbala ŋaanɛ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Baɔsɔna nsombya bango bauta e lisɔmbi ja dinali miya isato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Danali miya isato: yaiki nde bakuti baiki bɛɔya bako bokambi ɔmɔɔ wiilongi ɛmɔɔ</char></note> la bengo besanga mpakela baso boola!» E kantunda baphangweli ongo wainto.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kinaki, Yesu obaumboli: «Aliko laanke etaaŋangya nyo ɔnɛ wainto? Tika nyo ndako! Ingo imbokɛɛ ndako aliko lami ilende ekambwa lilɔti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Aliko ole nyo la baso boola luina lalikuli. La aɔsɔna nyo mbwamamola weeleko elangaki nyo. Kinaki lemi, phanjalaki la nyo biina lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Onɛ wainto okɛɛ ingo isani ndako nkɛɛ. Okichisa bauta ba limbala aliko la bionge bɛmi: «Otangoli nkicha aliko la nkunjama yami. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mbokosimela nyo, kolende sɔlɔ: kaama lalikuli bakondolɔndaka besao be Kanamombe* o boona, bakondo ɔmbɔlaka inɛ bimbo kɛɛ ɔnɛ wainto la wiinɛ bakondo okanyaka».<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ombo phaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikaliyɔtɛ, ɔmɔɔ a baeki* joomu la aphee ba Yesu, ochwe ele Bɛkɔta be baeta atei*. Aliko la mbwaphakela Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* baoki ingo, baiki la libɛla, baɔlakeli mbɔwɔya besanga. Yuda Isikaliyɔtɛ aanjisa mona eleko ɛlɔti ɛɔsɔna ndako mbwaphakela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombɔlɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-30">Mat 26.17-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luk 22.7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13.21-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Bk 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Wiina otango ba libɛla ba bitumbula koo bosunga biiyaki. Ko luina longo lojakaka bako bɔna ɔkɔkɔ ba ndɛ e Pasaka*. Baeki ba Yesu baumboli: «Ende elanga wɛɛ tokolɔngɔsɔlɛlɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka»?<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yesu otomi baphee ba Baeki* bande la mbwasimela: «Chwaka nyo ɔɔsɛngɛ, engo akondotana nyo bonto ɔmɔɔ ataɛmbɛ mpoke e iloko. Lingita nyo ndako», <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />nende e lulu laingela ndako. La simela nyo ɔmɛlɛ lulu: «Weekisi ombolɔnda kaama nke kele kyumba kende keleela ndako libɛla ja Pasaka* la Baeki* bande»? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />La ndako akondo baɛnya kyumba kɛnɛnɛ e Gɔlɔfa, kesili nɔngɔsɔlama aliko laso. Ango kalɔngɔsɔla iso lilɛ ja Pasaka*. <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Baeki* bapasi la nchwa wɔɔsɛngɛ. Batani bikambwa lalikuli bimbo lɔngɔsɔlama ŋango Yesu oasimeli la bake manja nɔngɔsɔla lilɛ ja Pasaka*.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Kwiki nde likɔlɔ. Yesu aiyisa bolili la Baeki* bande joomu laaphee. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Aiki bako batale, Yesu aasimeli: «Sɔlɔ mbo kosimela nyo, ɔmɔɔ anyo atale lami akondo mphaka».<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Baeki* bande ba sebalali la mbo wuumbola ɔmɔɔɔmɔɔ: «Ŋaande! Ilende lemi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu aasimeli: «Ɔmɔɔ asamba nyo joomu laaphe, atale lami ɛ lɔphɛphɛ lɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Lemi Bɔna a Onto lakondo jakema ŋango Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ lombo lɔnda: Ŋandi! Ele ongo onto, aɔsɔna limphaka. Kwiki nde bɔlɔchi phatootama»!<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />E ndɛɛ, Yesu ombo kemela kitumbula. Ombo lɔmba Kanamombe*, Oke ntena kengo kitumbula la ophakeli Baeki* bande la nɔnda: «Kemela nyo binɛ bilende bionge bɛmi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Lonkinɛ, okemeli bokoyo ba difai. Ombo sakoya Kanamombe*, la mbɔ ba ɔya Baeki* bande la banywe bako lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu aasimeli: «Bɛnɛ belende bekila bɛmi, bekila be mboloko* asamba Kanamombe* la banto. Bembo suuama aliko la boloi ba banto.» <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Yesu aasimeli: «Phanywaaki lonkinɛ difai* nende ango anywaki lemi difai* bekasende weekeleka e Kanamombe*».<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Pa ango, Yesu la Baeki* bande basili memba bɛkɛlwa ba nkucha Kanamombe*, bapasi, la mbulela o bɔɔkɔ ba Miseituni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ango Bayuda basili ndɛ lilɛ ja Pasaka*, baembaki bɔkɛlwa ba Sabuli 115 nende 118</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo lɔnda nte Pɛtɛlɛ akondo otata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu aasimeli Baeki* bande: «Akondo mbalaŋana nyo lalikuli. Aliko Lɔɔsi Lɔɛlɔ lɔmbɔlɔnda nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">«Lakondo jaka bochungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">La bekɔkɔ bekondo balaŋana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ Sakaliya 13.7. </char></note>».<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />«Kinaki, koonga ŋango, ango atondwa lemi, lakondo kotangolela nyo wɔɔsɛngɛ ba Galilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pɛtɛlɛ aosimeli: «Koonga bankinɛ lalikuli bakondo kobalaŋana, kinaki lemi, phankochikaki koonga inchɛ»!<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu aosimeli: «Mbokosimela sɔlɔ: bocho ba lɛlɔ, otamboka ba nkɔkɔ mbeka mala iphee, wɛɛ, akondo yala ombosila lintata mala isatɔ».<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kinaki, Pɛtɛlɛ akekemali la nɔnda: «Iya kasana mbwa olili labɛɛ mwimeya.» La Baeki* lalikuli balɔndi ŋango ako.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombolɔmba Kanamombe* e Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Pa, Yesu la Baeki* bande baiyi kaama kata elelama Getesemani, aasimeli: «Yala nyo anɛ lemi mbochwa nɔmba.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Pa, okemeli Pɛtɛlɛ la Yakɔbɔ la Yɔani, oke nɛmba bionge la mboka wɔɔma, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />La aasimeli: «Lisolo jami ilende la nkangi sukɛlɛ la mbwa. Yala nyo anɛ, ko lalake nyo».<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Pa ango, Yesu achwe otamboka inchɛ. Okomi balwe anyɔi la nɔmba ele Kanamombe* mbowaaŋanya weengo eleko e toakola, iya kasana. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Alɔndi: «Aba, Phapha, kabɛɛ bikambwa lalikuli be sanaka. Omaŋanyele la ongo bokoyo ba toakola! Kinaki koonga ŋango, kokɛɛkɛ ɲango alanga lɛmi, kinaki ŋango elanga wɛɛ».<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Pa, Yesu autoli ele bango Baeki* ba sato, aatani bambo lala. Laango aumboli Pɛtɛlɛ: «Iya onde Simo, ombo lala? Koo mba nkulu e ntikala baiso phololo, koo nga saa ɛmɔɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Yala nyo baiso phololo la nɔmba aliko kotaingelake nyo e mayalibu. Lisolo ilende la nkulu, kinaki, bionge bilende biɔɔlu»!<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu aachiki lonkinɛ la nchwa ŋango alɔmbi ndako otamboka. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Autoli lonkinɛ boleka baiki Baeki* bande basato aatani lonkinɛ bambo lala. Phaaɔsɔna ntikala baiso phololo aliko baiso baɔ baiki nde bɔlito la phaaeye nke e mbo ucheya. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Abaandeli lonkinɛ mala e isato engo eiki Baeki* bande, aasimeli: «Oloko nyo atalale la momoya? Kombo koka! Eleko kembwiya! Lemi Bɔna a Onto mbosila phakema waakasa baaso njambi! <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Emwa nyo, tochu! Ndaka nyo, ongo ata mphake ombo sukama»!<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkemelama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu aiki atalɔndɛ, kako nkango Yuda Isikaliyɔtɛ, ɔmɔɔ a Baeki* bande joomu laaphee ombwiya. Wiiki la boloi ba anto la nkula ntale la bephapho waakasa. Bango banto batomami la Bɛkɔta be baeta atei*, la Baekisi ba Isaliya* la Bekongo Beayuda*. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, aiki ombosila mbɔ ba ɔya imbali. Oke mbwasimela: «Ongo aɛbɛya lemi, ko ndako! Kemela nyo ndako, la mbɔɔtɔla la ookombelele nyo bɔlɔchi!» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ango aiye Yuda sukɛlɛ la Yesu, la kako nkango aɔsukameli la mboosimela: «Weekisi!» Lonkinɛ ombo okombesanya. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Laango bango banto baokemeli Yesu la mbɔɔlɛma. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kinaki, ɔmɔɔ a Baeki* ba Yesu kako nkango apasisha lokula lande e lophopha. Oke ntena litoi ya bokambi ɔmɔɔ ba Ɔkɔta be Baeta atei*.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu obaumboli: «Omwanda nyo linkemela la nkula la bephapho wɛɛnte baso manda nkemela bokumoli? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Biina lalikuli laiki la nyo e lulu la Kanamombe* la lataekya. Kinaki, koo nyo linkemela. Kinaki, imbo kɛɛma ŋango aliko lɔɔsi lɔɛlɔ lokoke.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Kako nkango Baeki* ba Yesu lalikuli ba balaŋani la nchwa lɔango.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kaiki la bompojo ɔmɔɔ alingitaki Yesu aiki atalɔtɛ intete ya esenda. Bango banto bakɛkɛli mbookemela, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Kinaki ndako aatikeli ingo intete yande ya esenda la nchwa phololo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu otamboka ba mbalasa Bɛɛkɔta Baayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bango banto batɔli Yesu ele Bɔkɔta be baeta atei*. Ango, Bɛkɔta lalikuli be baeta atei*, Bekongo Beayuda* la Baekisi ba Isaliya* ba saŋani. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pɛtɛlɛ alingiti Yesu ole bɔɔ la aingeli o kiwanja ke lulu la Ɔkɔta be baeta atei*. Ayali kaama kamɔɔ laachungi bataoke iya.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bango Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* la bankinɛ Bekongo Beayuda* lalikuli baonaki bemongo be masitaki aliko la mboo jaka. Kinaki, koo mba. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Banto ike ba pasisha usuula ba belimbo aliko la Yesu, kinaki, usuula bɛɔ koo mbokana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Pa, bankinɛ asamba bako baemali, bapasisha ma usuula ba elimbo la nɔnda: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Tata iyokela atalɔndɛ nte: ‹Lakondo phanjolaka lɔnɛ lulu la Kanamombe* lophikami laakasa baanto, la o biina esato lakondo phikaka lonkinɛ lole phalaphikami laakasa baanto›».<verse eid="MRK 14:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kinaki, koonga ŋango, usuula baɔ koo mbokana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Laango, Bɔkɔta ba baeta atei* aemali asamba bako, la aumboli Yesu: «Onde, Phauchɛya ekambwa? Wiinɛ lalikuli bitakositaki banto aliko la bɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kinaki Yesu wiikɔwɛli, koo mbuchɛya ekambwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Lonkinɛ, ongo Bɔkɔta owuumboli: «Wɛɛ kole Kilisito*, Bɔna a Kanamombe* ɔnɛ atakucha iso?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu abuuchisa: «Ole, Ko lɛmi! Akondo ɛna nyo lemi Bɔna a Onto latayale boleka ba loome la Kanamombe* ɔmɛlɛ nkulu, lonkinɛ akondo mɛna nyo, lataande mima e loola asamba loonge».<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ango, aoki Bɔkɔta ba baeta atei* bingo aati bisɛnda bende la nɔnda: «Tapha lonkinɛ la mposa ba asuula aliko la ɔnɛ bonto! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Wiiyokeli nyo ŋango atatole ndako Kanamombe*. Nke etakanya nyo»?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bako lalikuli balɔndi asana mbwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Laango, bamɔɔ waango banto baanjisa mboochwela Yesu lɔsɔi. La mboolipha esenda weelongi ende, la mboophoma nsola la mboosimela: «Lɔnda nani ombo kophoma!» La Bakɔlɔbɔi laako baokɛmɛli la mboophoma nsola.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɛ ombo tata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:53-62">Luk 22.53-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18.15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">Yoa 18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Weengo eleko, Pɛtɛlɛ aiki oloko e kiwanja ke Ɔkɔta be baeta atei*. Bokambi ɔmɔɔ a wainto ba Ɔkɔta aiyisa ango aiki Pɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aɛni Pɛtɛlɛ ataoke iya aolendi la mboosimela: «La bɛ wiiki la Yesu a Nasaleti!» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kinaki Pɛtɛlɛ akili la obuuchisa: «Phalaeye la phala oke ingo bitaone wɛɛ nɔnda!» Lonkinɛ, Pɛtɛlɛ apasi e kiwanja la nchwa e lɔkukɛ, kako nkango nkɔkɔ kemboeka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ongo wainto aɛni ndako lonkinɛ Pɛtɛlɛ, asimeli banto baiki ango: «Ɔnɛ bonto olende ɔmɔɔ abɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Kinaki, Pɛtɛlɛ atati lonkinɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Mbeta inchɛ, bango baiki ango bambo lɔnda lonkinɛ ele Pɛtɛlɛ: «Sɔlɔ, olende ɔmɔɔ abɔ, aliko wɛɛ, olende bonto a wooni ba Galilaya!» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Kinaki, Pɛtɛlɛ aanjisa mpasha besao beolo la ndapa la nɔnda: «Lemi phalaweeye ɔnɛ onto atalɔndɛ nyo besako bende. Iya mbɔlɔnda belimbo Kanamombe* antumbya!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Kako nkango, nkɔkɔ kembo eka mala e iphee. Laango Pɛtɛlɛ, ombo kanya ingo eosimeli Yesu: «Otamboka ya mbeka ya nkɔkɔ mala iphee, akondo yala ombo sila lintata mala isato.» La Pɛtɛlɛ ombo lela.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotɔlama ele Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Mpendu fuɔ, Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* basaŋani o yuungu la Bekongo Beayuda*, la Baikisi ba Isaliya* ko nɔnda mbalasa nɛnɛ Laayuda, baɔlɛmi Yesu la mbɔɔtɔla ele Pilato.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Baiyisa ele Pilato, la awuumboli Yesu: «Wɛɛ kole Bɔkɔta Baayuda*?» Yesu ombo wuucheya: «Wɛɛ kombo lɔnda»!<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* baositaki Yesu weesao ike. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato awuumboli lonkinɛ Yesu: «Onde, Phaucheya ekambwa wiinɛ lalikuli bimbo kositaka bako?» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kinaki, Yesu koo mbuwucheya ekambwa, laango Pilato o sebalali.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waatande ba mbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila eleko ja libɛla ja Pasaka, Pilato aiki la bolengo e nɛmɔlɛla banto bolɛmi o munyɔlɔlɔ ɔnɛ asɔna bako. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />La kaiki etamba ɛmɔɔ aelelamaki Balaba, aiki atalɛmama o munyɔlɔlɔ la bankinɛ bajaki, aliko ba jaki onto ango bakiisa bako boyongo ba ɔsɛngɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Boloi baanto bachweli Pilato baosimeli: «Otokɛɛlɛ iso lonkinɛ ŋango botokɛɛlaka wɛɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato abaumboli: «Atalange nyo nte nkɔlɛmɔlɛle nyo Bɔkɔta Baayuda*?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Alɔndi ŋango, aliko aeyi bɔlɔti, Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* baophaki Yesu aliko la bomanda.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kinaki bango Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* ba tomi banto baɔlɔmbɛ Pilato aalɛmɔlɛlɛ Balaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato obaumboli lonkinɛ: «Alanga nyo nkɛɛ ŋaande la ɔnɛ onto ataelela nyo Bɔkɔta ba Mayaudi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Banto lalikuli baokomi lonkinɛ: «Lɛma nyo ndako waalemba»!<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato obaumboli lonkinɛ: «Ɔmbɔ kɛɛ bobe nke»? Kinaki baphaphi mbokoma la nkulu: «Lɛma nyo ndako waalemba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato aliko la nangya banto aalɛmɔlɛli Balaba. Apasisha luusa baophome Yesu bephapho, pa, aopasisha Yesu baɔlɛmɛ waalemba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakɔlɔbɔi bata weelolela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Pa ango, Bakɔlɔbɔi baɛlisa Yesu e kiwanja, ke Bɔkɔta ba wooni. Baeleli boloi baɔ lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Aliko la mboweelolela Yesu, bake mbɔɔlɔcha esenda e nkola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ele Bayuda esenda e nkola yaaki esenda ɛɔkɔta</char></note> la mbɔta enkaka e baumba, la mbɔɔlɔcha wɔɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ango baanjisa mbɔwɛɛbɛya la nɔnda: «Ɔmbwɛ wɛɛ Bɔkɔta Baayuda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bambo ophoma litɛtɛ aliko la bɔtɛ la mboochweela lɔsɔi. Bambo kɔma balwe aliko la mbo wiinamela nende e lɔmɔtu otamboka lande. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ango basili bako mboweelolela, baopasisha engo esenda e nkola, la mbɔɔlɔcha lonkinɛ bisenda bende. Lonkinɛ, bapasi la ndako anja, aliko la mbowuuleya waalemba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waalemba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ango aiki bako e mboka basaŋani la bonto ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Simoni bonto ba wooni ba Kilɛni, aiki isɛnde la Alekisande la Lufu wiiki ataime wiibeli. Bakɔlɔbɔi bake mbookaka aɛmbɛ balenba ba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Pa, batɔli Yesu kaama kataelelama Gologota, ko nɔnda «Kaama ka ɛpɔkɔsɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />La bawɔɔyisa difai beluanyi bako la manɛmanɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manɛmanɛ baiki nde bosunga ba nkicheya nkangi</char></note>. Kinaki Yesu akili nywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Pa, bawuulisa waalemba. Baphaki esenda ende o nkɛɛ esiko aliko la mbeya nani aɛmba yaati. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kaiki nde saa e isato e mpendu ango awuulisa bako waalemba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Bango Bakɔlɔbɔi baandiki wiiteni e lɔbaɔ besao bingo betiki Yesu achu waalemba. Bengo besao belɔndi nte: «Bɔkɔta Baayuda».<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bawuulisa Yesu waalemba la bakumoli ba phee, ɔmɔɔ o likasa e loome la ɔnkinɛ e likasa la lɔali. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Wiingo lɔɔsi lɔɛlɔ la kɔkyami ŋango baandekami: «Bawaanjisa kaama kamɔɔ la bakumoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28.</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Luk 22.37; Isaya 53.12.</char></note>»].<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Banto banɛ baetaki ango batolaki Yesu la ntɛkya bɛtɛ bɛɔ la nɔnda: «Haa! Wɛɛ wiiki atalɔndɛ nte akondo phanjola lulu la Kanamombe* la mbolopika o biina besato! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Nkaanɛ kitela waango alemba la wiikakole wɛɛmɛlɛ»!<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ŋango ako, Bɛkɔta be baeta atei* la baekisi ba Isaliya* ba weelolisa Yesu la nɔnjana asamba bako: «Akakoli bankinɛ kinaki, phaɔsɔna mbwikakola nɛmɛlɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Iya ndako ko Masiya*, Bɔkɔta ba Isilaeli, akitele waalemba! Tɔɛni la tokicha lokani.» Koonga bango banto bauleli kaama kamɔɔ la ndako waalemba la bako baotoli.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />La saa e isamalo nende saa e libwa wiilima baingeli wooni lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />La saa e libwa Yesu aokomi la nkulu: «Elɔi, Elɔi, lama sabakitani» Ko nɔnda: «Kanamomnbe ami, Kanamombe ami, aliko laanke emosanjiya wɛɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔsɔmɛ: Sabuli 22.</char></note>»?<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Waango banto baiki ango, bamɔɔ ba wooki la nɔnda: «Oka nyo! Ombo elela Eliya»! <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ achwe lɔango aili baambu otema ba difai ba okai, la nɛma ɛ nsɔli e litɛtɛ, lonkinɛ osemboli ele Yesu nte anywa la mboosimela: «Konga, takondo ɛna iya Eliya aanda mbookicheya waalemba»! <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kinaki, Yesu ookomi lonkinɛ la nkulu la nkɔphɔla lisolo.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Laango, esenda eiki etalɛmama e lulu la Kanamombe yaati biati biphee, manja eliko nende entina. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ango Bɔkɔta baakɔlɔbɔi Baalɔma aiki ataemala otamboka ba Yesu. Ango aɛni ndako Yesu ombo kɔphɔla lisolo alɔndi: «Sɔlɔ ɔnɛ onto wiikinde bɔna a Kanamombe»!<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bamɔɔ bainto baiki ango la baiki batalende bɔɔ. Asamba bako, kwiki nde Maliya ana Magadala la Salɔmɛ la Maliya nyɛŋɛnde la Yakɔbɔ mpɔu la a Yɔsɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bango nde balingitaki Yesu la mbookambela ango aiki ndako Galilaya. Kwiki ango bainto bankinɛ ike bauleli landako e Yɛlusalɛma.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔsɛfu ombokunja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Aiki kako likɔlɔ, kapaseli mpame ɔmɔɔ aelelamaki Yɔsɛfu bonto ba wooni ba Alimatɛya. Ɔnɛ Yɔsɛfu aiki la bokuchu bɔnɛnɛ o mbalasa e Bayuda* lonkinɛ aiki ata konge manda ya ekeleka e Kanamombe. Mɛna nte longo luina laiki nde luina la nɔngɔsɔla Sabato*, Yɔsɛfu alɛmi lisolo achwe ele Pilato nɔmba bojo be Yesu aliko la nkunja. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato asebalali mboka nte Yesu ombosila mbwa. Laango, oweeleli Bɔkɔta baakɔlɔbɔi Baaloma aliko la mbowuunbola iya ombosila nembela ambobwa ndako. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato mbucheyama la ongo Bɔkɔta baakɔlɔbɔi nte Yesu ombosila nkɔphɔla lisolo, aɔyisa Yɔsɛfu luusa la memba bojo ba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yɔsɛfu achwe nsɔmba malɛkani. Achwe la yako, la akichisa bojo ba Yesu waalemba, oke mboolinga la sanda la oke nkicheya bojo otema ba jombo ja timami o libwɛ linɛnɛ. Lonkinɛ, oke nɛngya libwɛ linɛnɛ aliko la ndipha o lɔkukɛ la lingo jombo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Laango Maliya ana Magadala la Maliya nyɛŋɛnde la Yɔsɛ, baiki bataɛni kaama kakichisa bako bojo ba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ntondwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ango asili Sabato*, Maliya ana Magadala la Salɔmɛ la Maliya nyɛŋɛnde la Yakɔbɔ basɔmbi bauta ba limbala aliko la nchwa nsuula e bionge be yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Luina la iinga mpendu, baiyisa e jombo eepaselo e yaani. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />E mboka baiki batalɔnjana bako amɛlɛ: «Nani atopaseya lingo libwɛ o lɔkukɛ la joombo?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kinaki balɛndi baɛni libwɛ pa mpashema e lɔkukɛ, la jako liiki nde linɛnɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bango bainto, baingɛli o jombo, baɛni bompojo ɔmɔɔ, alɔti esenda yɛɛlɔ pɛɛ atayale boleka ba loome, ango ba wɛɛni bako bake ndawa. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kinaki ongo bomponjo aasimeli nte: «Kolawake nyo! Mbweya nte ataone nyo Yesu a Nasalɛti, ɔnɛ ajaki bako waalemba. Ombo sila ntondwa, achiki anɛ. Ndaka kaama kaiki bako bambo o laja. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Kinaki, chwaka nyo lokosimele baeki bande la Pɛtɛlɛ nte Yesu ombo kotangolela nyo e Galilaya. Akondo wɛɛna nyo engo, ŋango akosimeli nyo ndako.» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Kako nkango bango bainto bapasi ango e jombo lɔango baiki bata sɔkɛ la nsebalala. La koo nsimela bonto lalikuli ekambwa, aliko baiki la bɔɔma.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombo pasela Maliya ana Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[Ango Yesu atondwe luina la iinga mpendu, aiɛnyisa obi ele Maliya ana Magadala. Ɔnɛ Yesu aopasisha basombo esamba ele. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ongo Maliya achwe nsimela baeki ba Yesu bango baolingitaki, bango baiki* elotoko batalele. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kinaki, ango aoki bako Maliya ana Magadala ombo asimela nte ɔwɛɛni Yesu la olende e luiko! Koo mbo wiimeya. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombopasela baeki bande ba phee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Pa ango, Yesu apaseli Baeki* bande ba phee baiki batachu weebeli, aiki oke la inkinɛ yiima. Bango baeki bachwaki nde weebeli. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bango baeki baphee bautoli nchwa nsimela baina labɔ besako. Kinaki bango baina labɔ koo mimeya.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombotoma Baeki joomu la ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bsb 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Lonkinɛ, Yesu ombwiɛnya e baeki bande joomu la ɔmɔɔ, ango baiki bako batale. Ombwaaphangwela la mbwasimela: «Aliko laanke koo limimeya nyo la koo linanga nyo! Aliko laanke koo mimeya banɛ ba mɛni o luiko»?<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />E kantunda, Yesu aasimeli: «Chwaka nyo e wooni lalikuli, ataekya nyo besako be Kanamombe waanto lalikuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ɔnɛ aimɛya la mbatisama, ongo akondo kakolama. Kinaki ɔnɛ ole phaimɛya, ongo akondo chwa batande.<verse eid="MRK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />«La bango baimeyaka, bakondo kɛɛka bintɔmpɔ e bokuchu ba Kanamombe: bakondo itaka basombo babe la bakondo lɔndaka nsɔmwa ya kasende, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />bakondo kemela ndwa laakasa baɔ, la iya banywake lɔlɛngo, phayaakɛɛ ekambwa. Bakondo aphya bakasa eliko la bakɔnu la bakonu ba kondo ika».<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ombuulela e loola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bsb 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Laango Yesu asili nɔnda la baeki bande bengo besao, ombo sakolama e loola, la ombo chwa njala o loome la Kanamombe. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Bango baeki bande bachwe bataekya kaama lalikuli besako be Kanamombe. Yesu akambaki kaama kamɔɔ la bako la mbɔba ɔya bokuchu ba nkɛɛka bintɔmpɔ ike, o mɛnya nte besao beekyaki bako banto belende sɔlɔ].<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>